<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">John</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">John</para>
  <para style="mt1">John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Cikarigo cina ci pa a̱huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ni jigu a doone aza Cikarigo, Cikarigo ciniya ciyiwa, hinda cikarigo cini ciyiwa na Hwinsu, Cikarigo cini cisa Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ube usa cikarigo cina ciyiwa na Hwinsu tun na jigu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Hinda pa bware Hwinsu uba ia̱g iyi ka̱mu; Ni cidaka ci bware hinda Hwinsu uba ia̱gi tibai, aza ko ni iyi binka ina Hwinsu uba ia̱gi sa na bware. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Cikarigo ciniya cibe cisa yina a̱huru, hinda a̱huru ni ube usa cingero pa aco ka̱mu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Cengero cini cima katiyi na ci'incu, hinda ci'incu ciza kuce pa cingero uniya. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Aza buco buna abu ugo Yohana, Hwinsu bu cuma bware. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Buna bu kurya bu zwama aco cikarogo ci cengero ciniya, zwama ka̱mu aco a huge numa niya hinda a tani soo. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Sa Yohana abe usa cengero uniya ama bware bu kurya zwam bu zwame aco ka̱mu cikarigo ci cengero uniya. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Cingero uniya usa u kamahinda cengero una wa kurya zwama u katiyi aco doone ka̱mu. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Na jigu cikarigo cini ciyiwa na doone, hinda Hwinsu u doone ni cidaka ci bware, ka̱mu na haruni aco doone ai ciwo bwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />bware bu kurya i'ogo iba, ama aco bware ai cyaguwa bware. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ama ka̱mu aco na a ce bwa hinda a tani soo na bware; bware bu pan ga koce a sana saawo sa Hwinsu <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ai sa saawo sa Hwinsu na yina aco doone, sa na imaco i ikanga na mahya i aco hinda, ama asa saawo sa Hwinsu buna busa buca bu buco buba. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Noma ni isa buco hinda, u sinji na i burya̠ na kamahinda, ana ayiwa na gaci. Ci hyan izangacu i bware, izangaco cina ci bware ciba cya pa Buca buna bu singi na i burya̠ na kamahinda, zwam bube busa Bwa bu Buca̱ bu buba. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana i iyi cikarigo ci bware. &lt;&lt;Bube busa buna bu gya na ia̱g cikarogo ci bware buna bu gya na hin. &lt;Bu kurya kacutu na gya, ama bu na zaki na cilabe na koce, zwama bware bu yiwa tun ana macuwa.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Zwama i burya̠ bware dinya bu ci tane unu u burya̠ tunahun uinka na uinka. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Hwinsu ube u pa icibago ci wuba pa Musa, amma i burya̠ na kamahinda bu kurya pa Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Aza buco buna bwa tabo hyan Hwinsu. Bwa bu Hwinsu buba, buna busa nga̱ Hwinsu hinda buyiwa tare na Buca̱, aci san gaci daki bwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana u Baptisma u i numa zwama Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Huna Hayahudawa haba cuma alabe labe na halawiyawa pa Yohana, na Urshalima zwama a kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Gabwe busa gamba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana bui zwamaga cibya, ama bware zwamaga kamahinda, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Sa gyamui nasa Kristi Bucyagagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />&lt;&lt;Busa gamba, kwa?&gt;&gt; a kaba̱ bware &lt;&lt;Busa Iliya&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Aye ni sa bware, Ni sawa,&gt;&gt; Yahaya bu cyane ga. &lt;&lt;Ko busa bucubago Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; a kaba̱ bware. &lt;&lt;Aye,&gt;&gt; bware bu cyane ga. <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />&lt;&lt;Cizwamagya busa gamba,&gt;&gt; a kaba̱ bware. ci gimbo hyan cikarigo acibui zwama gaci zwama aco na aci cuma. Biya goo bu hin zwama gabui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yahaya u cyane ga na izwamago ina Acubago Hwinsu Ishaya buba hin: &lt;&lt;Gya, &lt;nasa bicwaro bi bucahya na sana ci'og ni hila: I kimga yina una za ciri pa Buca̱ bu yaba uba i cihana!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Acuma ana Haparisiyawa cumaga tun na jigo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Kwa aba na kaba̱ Yahaya, &lt;&lt;Si bui sa Kristi Bucyagagu ko Iliya, hinda bui sawa Acubago Hwinsu, biya sa goo bu yiwa na ia̱g aco baptisma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Kwa Yohana bu cyane ga, &lt;&lt;Ni iyi baptisma na miya, amma aza buna buyiwa na ga̱hi buna ga̱hi i dakuwo. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Bu yiwa na kure kacuta akamu, buna ni panuwa pasinga birigi bi hataka ha bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ka̱mu ini a ia̱ na i'og i Betani, na usala u uwo u Yodan, ihuga ina Yohana iba yanse na ia̱g baptisma.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udwumaga i Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bonge kwa Yohana uba na hyan Yesu &lt;&lt;Hyniji Udwumaga u Hwinsu una u zangi magwata̱ ma aco doone! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Bube busa buna bu gya na yiwa na zwama ga nga̱ gya na hyin, &lt;Buco bu yiwa na kurya kacuta na gya, amma bu ni zake ni cilabe na koce, zwama bu yiwa tun ana macuwa.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Gya ma na jigo na dakuwo bwa, ama na kurya gya ia̱g baptisma zwama a cibe bware pa aco Isra'ila a daki bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Hinda Yohana bu zwame ka̱mu ina pale: &lt;&lt;Na hyan a̱huru a Hwinsu ayiwa na kasinga zata zaro nga̱ tarkagu bu yinsa pa ikanga i bware. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Gya ma na jigo na dakuwo ana bube, kwa nga̱ Hwinsu buna bu ni cuma gya ia̱ baptisma na miya, uba na zwama, &lt;Bui hyan a̱huru a Hwinsu na kasinga pa buco nga̱ ihurugu; bube bui ia̱g baptisma na a̱huru a Hwinsu.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Gya hinda Yohana na hyan haruni wa pale,&gt;&gt; Yohana bu hin, &lt;&lt;Hinda na bu zwama bube busa Bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Silmajiri si Yesu sa jigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa kurya Yohana uba na yisa na silmajiri si bware barya̱, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Nga̱ bware bu hyan Yesu na jabaga na. &lt;&lt;Byan bube busa udwumaga Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; bware bu hin. <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Silmajiri si Yohana barya siba sa huge bware na hin haruni kwa aba na lagan Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Nga̱ Yesu uba na byana ga ayiwa na laga bware, bu kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Biya ga̱hin yiwa na gimbo?&gt;&gt; Aba na cyani bware, &lt;&lt;Hunba goo bu yiwa na dala, Rabbi?&gt;&gt; (Rabbi asa &lt;&lt;Walami.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />&lt;&lt;Kurya i hyan,&gt;&gt; Yesu bu cyane ga. (Na misali u karpe nasi na yumbe.) Kwa silmajiri si bware aba na laga Yesu kure i hyan i hugo ina bware na dala, kwa aba na yisa na bware hal ihogu i hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Bucagiya busa Andarawus buhunwa bu Saminu ana aba ogo Bitrus, bware bu yiwa na silmajiri barya si Yohana sina sa laga Yesu, nga̱ aba hug cikarigo ci Yesu pa Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Wa sanuwo kwa Andarawus bu hin na buhunwa bu bware Saminu, Ci hyan Bucagagu Almasihu.&gt;&gt; (Buna bui na nupi &lt;&lt;Kristi.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kwa Andarawus ne kula Saminu pa Yesu. Yesu bu byana bware kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Iziya nibu isa Siminu bwa bu Yohana, amma baniya a bu uga Kefas ko Bitrus buna bu yiwa na nupi &lt;&lt;Tare&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i uga Filibus na Nataniyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bunge kwa Yesu aba na yina u kurwo u Galili. bware bu bangi Filibus bu hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ni laganya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />(Filibus busa buco bu Betsaida, i'ogo i Andarawus na Bitrus.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filibus bu bangi Nataniyel na zwama bware , &lt;&lt;Ci hyan buna bu Acuma Hwinsu Musa uba rubuci na atakada a icibago i Musa hinda buna bu acubago Hwinsu uba rubuci cikarigo ci bware. Bube busa Yesu bwa bu Yusuf, ana a cinge ci Nazaret.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Kwa Nataniyel u kaba bu hin, &lt;&lt;Aza i burya̠ ina i sirya na Nazaret?&gt;&gt; Filibus bu cyane bware, &lt;&lt;Kurya hyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Nga̠ Yesu uba hyan Nataniyel na kurya pa bware, kwa na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Byana buco bu Isra'ila bu kamahinda; buna bu za cibya na soo u bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Kwa Nataniyel na kaba̱ Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Niya goo buna daki?&gt;&gt; Yesu bu cyani bware, &lt;&lt;Na bu hyan tun hunna goo bu yiwa na ihugo u'o muco Kapin Filibus bu uga. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />&lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; Nataniyel bu cyana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gabwe busa bwa bu Hwinsu! Busa Bugwama bu ha Isra'ila!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu bu hin na Nataniyel, &lt;&lt;Bu tani soo zwama na bu zwaman ana na hyan na u'o muco? Bui hyan i na zaki i mamaki dinya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Kwa Yesu na gupa hyan na ba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama: i hyan zaro ui gunja na acuma a Hwinsu na kure zata hinda na kasinga pa icwa i Bwa bu Buwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Lago u cigya na i'og Kana a Galil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Nga̱ muhun mutaco mu kurya aza lago cigya na i'ogo i Ka'ana na Galili. Amaci a Yesu ayiwa pa ihuga i lago iniya. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />A ugan Yesu na silmajiri si bware si kure pa lago i cigya cini. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Nga̱ miya ma inabi ma hogi, kwa amaci a Yesu a zwama bware, &lt;&lt;Miya ma inabi ma aco lago ma hogu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu a cyana amace a bware bu hyen, &lt;&lt;Amaci numui biya sa goo bu kure ihugo ina?&gt;&gt; Yesu bu cyane, &lt;&lt;Lokaci numui wa sa kurya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Kwa amaci a Yesu na zwaman agyama, &lt;&lt;Ka ka̱mu ina buba i zwama ganhi ia̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Hayahudawa hinda aza al'ada a iguzagu ana a ila hatako, zwama asa hatako a hatare buna aba ia̱gi na hatare zwama lago, ka̱mu hatako hani hai pwana i zangi adanda dari uika u miya. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Kwa Yesu na hyen na aco lago, &lt;&lt;I sinji ka̱mu hatako na miya&gt;&gt;; kwa aba na sinji nga̱ bware buba zwama ga. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kwa Yesu na hyen na ba &lt;&lt;Baniya i hingya cimu goo pa buco bu lagi.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na ia̱ haruni. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Miya maniya ma sana miya ma inabi kwa buco bu lagi buba rwago na so cimu. Bware hinda bui dakuwo ihugu ina aba hyan miya ma inab. Amma agyama na sinji hatako na miya ha daki ka̱mu ihuga ina ya sirya. kwa Yesu na uga Ango. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />kwa bware na hyen na bware, &lt;&lt;Tigamba buyiwa na pan miya ma inabi ma burya̠ , si aco a so dinya hinda bware bui kula ana ai gyamacuwa dinya; ama goo bu ma swinyi mana ma burya̠ , kwa baniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ina isa i mamaki u jigo una Yesu uba iyi na ka'ana na galili. Na haruni bware bu ciba cilabe ci bware, kwa silmajiri si bware siba na jidana tani soo pa bware.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu u ise iginga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi haruni, kwa bware na ala Kaparnahum na amace a bware na ahun bware ka̱mu na silmajiri si bware. ahwaya aba i dala muhun cimu. <verse eid="JHN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Nga̱ lago ui kacigago ui Hayahudawa wa kurya, kwa Yesu bu kuri Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Na suwa u ijapu Iginga Yesu bu bangi aco na sanga bina, hatamui na mutantabara, hinda cyagiya aco a madaliye na rutaga musare. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Kwa Yesu na pyace bulala u birigi, bu ance aco ka̱mu na sala wui Iginga, bware bu ance ka̱mu na bina na hatamui na hatarkagu; hinda bu jiga musare mana aba na rutaga hinda bu gipi hatebur. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Kwa Yesu na zwama aco na yiwa na sanga mutantabara, &lt;&lt;Silacuma ina pini! Ita ringya i yaba i Buca̱ abumui i ma ringiya i huga i sanga na isango!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />nga̱ ini ya pale, kwa silmajiri si bware na mabuturage na ina aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu: &lt;&lt;Isiba ina gya na zi pa yaba Hwinsu ayiwa na re soo nimui nga̱ ula.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Kwa hayahudawa ha kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Umba i mamaki goo bui ia̱ una ui ci ciba ana buzi koce bu iyi ka̱mu iyi na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu a cyane ga, bu hin, &lt;&lt;Si i hacigaga iginga na, gya ni pwan kimga na muhun mutaco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Kwa hayahudawa a cyane bwa, &lt;&lt;Ci i haya kupe nasi na cunihi ciyiwa na ia̱g ima i Iginga na! goo hinda bu hyen ana bui pwa ia̱g na muhun mutaco?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Amma ima iginga na Yesu uba ia̱g cikarigo ciwab cisa ikanga i bware. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Nga̱ Hwinsu uba wasingoo Yesu pa aco na a kwadaga, kwa silmajiri si bware na mabuturage ina Yesu iba hin naba. kwa aba na tani soo pa ina a rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu na cikarigo cina ci Yesu uba zwama ga.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i daki suwa wa aco ka̱mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Baniya nga̱ Yesu ayiwa na Urshalima zwama lago ui kacigago, aco dinyiya aba hyan i mamaki ina Yesu uba i kwa aba na tani soo na izi i bware. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ama Yesu ai yajuwa naba, zwama bware bu daki soo ha aco ka̱mu dinyiya. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Zwama bware bui ka̱ruwo buco bu i shaida u buco, zwama bu daki ina i yiwa na soo u buco.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nikodimus u kurya pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Aza buco buna busa Bayahude buna aba uga Nikodimos, bware busa buco bu labe majalisa ma Haparisiyawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Aza hunna na gita Nikodimus bu kurya pa Yesu na bu hyen, &lt;&lt;Walami, ci daki goo busa walami buna bu Hwinsu uba cuma. Aza buna bwe pwa ia̱g i mamaki nga̱ go bu ia̱gu kwa si Hwinsu u yiwa na buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Kwa yesu na cyani bwa, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, aza buna bwe ise cigwama ci Hwinsu kwa a gupa amaco bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Kwa nikodimos ne kaban, &lt;&lt;Niya buco na a'unga a bware bwe ise na mukaba ma amaci a bware hinda a maco bwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu na cyane bware, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda, na zwama, aza buna bwe ise cigwama ci Hwinsu kwa a maco bware na miya hinda na a̱huru a Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Iyi na buco bu maco busa buco, ama a̱huru a Hwinsu a maco a̱huru. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ta huga mamaki zwama na hin ana kwa a maco hinda. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />mupyala muyiwa na hulan ka̱mu ihuga ina uba ka̱ri. buyiwa na hugi cihana ciwab. Ama buza i daki ihuga ina ya sirya ko hinda ihuga ina i kure. Haruni uba yiwa na tigamba buna aba maco na a̱huru a Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodimos bu gupan kaba.&lt;&lt;Niya ina ya sana?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Kwa Yesu na cyani bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Goo busa walami a labe ni Isra'ila hinda bui dakuwo ina? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Kamahinda na zwama, ci zwama ina gaci daki, hinda na pan sheda ina gaci hyan, ama ka̱mu na haruni ga̱hi ai ciwo numa nuci. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Na yiwa na bu ia̱gya cikarigo na i doone ama ai tano soo; niya ga̱hi ai tani soo na cikarigo ci Cigwama ci Hwinsu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Aza buna bu taba kure zaro-kwa di Bwa bu Buwama buna bwa kasinga pa zaro. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Nga̱ Musa uba a ahwa u i ruma i sane zata ni hila, harbuni hinda aba ai zanga Bwa bu Buwama na zata, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />zwama ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na bware bui hyin a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />&lt;&lt;Zwama Hwinsu u ka̱ri aco doone hal bu ci pa Bwa bu bware buinka buna bu buba ka̱ri, ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na bware buza ikwaji ama bu hyin a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Zwama Hwinsu ui cuma Bwa bu bware zwama bu ia̱ doone shara'a, ama bu cagage aco doone pa bware. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na Bwa bu Hwinsu aza ia̱gya ga shara'a, ama ka̱mu buna bui yajuwa na bware ai ia̱gu bwa shara'a, zwama bui tanuwa soo na Bwa bu Hwinsu buika. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Harbuni hinda hukunci u yiwa: Cingero ci kurya pa doone, ama aco a ka̱ri ci'incu na cingero a yanse cingero zwama ibwana i aco isa eewo. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ka̱mu buna bu yiwa na ia̱g eewo buza ka̱ri cingero, hinda buza kurya pa cingero zwama iwasa i ibwana i eewo bware iza na cisuyi. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ama ka̱mu buna bu yiwa na ia̱ dala a kamahinda bui kurya pa cingero, zwama ai hyan ka̱mu ina buba ia̱ bu ia̱gi nga̱ Hwinsu uba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana u Baptisma bu gupe pa sheda zwam Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ban na haruni, Yesu na silmajiri si bware a kure pa usala Yahudiya, apayi bware bu sana naba, na ia̱ baptisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana hinda bu yiwa na ia̱ baptisma na Ainon ihugabina aba ia̱gi Yohana baptisma imere na Salim, zwama aza miya dinya apaya, hinda aco dinya ayiwa na kurya zwama a ia̱gya ga baptisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Ini pale kapin a tani Yohana na ukaba u ci'incu.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Sicagiya silmajiri si Yohana si na rwaga masasa na Bayahude zwama al'ada a iguzagu i ikanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Kwa aba kure pa Yohana na hyen na bware, &lt;&lt;Walami, bu mabutaryage, Buco buna bu yiwa na goo na zata sala u Yodan-buna bu goo bu i sheda u buba-bware buyiwa apaya na ia̱ baptisma, hinada aco dinya na kure pa bware&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana a cyane ga na hin, &lt;&lt;Aza buco buna bui pa hyan i kwa Hwinsu bu pa. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />ga̱hi ma isa sheda nga̱ gya na hin, &lt;Ni sawa Kristi, ama ani cuma gya kure kapi bware.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Na lago cigya, marya asa pa ango. a'osa a ango bui yinsa na hugi bicaro bi ango, hinda bu sinji na wa̱wo si bu hugi bicaro bi amarya na ango. wawo u ci usa numui, hinda u sinji. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Dole buco buna bu munsuwo, gya hinda ai na cakan.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ina ya sirya na zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />&lt;&lt;Hinda Yesu buna bu sirya pa zata bu yiwa na zata i ka̱mu; hinda buna bu sirya pa doone busa bu doone, hinda bu iyi cikarigo nga̱ buca̱ bu doone. Buna bu sirya pa zaro bu yiwa zata na aco ka̱mu. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Buyiwa na sheda ina i buba hyan na ina buba huge, ka̱mu na haruni ai yajuwa na cikarig ci buba. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />ama ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na alama a sheda bware, bware bu tabaci ana Hwinsu usa u kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ama buna bu Hwinsu buba cuma bu yiwa na ia̱ cikarigo ci Hwinsu, zwama Hwinsu bu pa a̱huru a Hwinsu ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Hwinsu Buca̱ bu ka̱ri bwa bu buba hinda bu pa bware iyi ka̱mu na kuce wa u buba. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ka̱mu buna bu yaje na bwa bu Hwinsu bwe hyan a̱huru ana aza ihogu, ama ka̱mu buna bu yagage Bwa bu buba buza hyan a̱huru, zwama i hacigage soo i Hwinsu iyiwa pa buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na bu'a bu Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Haparisiyawa a hugi labari ana Yesu bu zaki Yohana na ia̱ baptisma hinda na hyan silmajiri, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />ama sa Yesu na icwa i buba iba na ia̱ ga baptisma ama silmajiri si bware. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Nga̱ Yesu buba hugi haruni, kwa bware na curi Yahudiya, na kure Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />U sa dole pa Yesu bu laga suwa Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ni Samariya nga̱ Yesu iba wuci i'ogo ina aba yiwa na uga Saikar na cinge ci Siriya, ciyabu na cinge cina Yakub uba pa bwa bu bware Yusuf. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Apaya iwaga i Yakub iyiwa, nga̱ Yesu iba nibwa kwa bware na hupacu ciyabu na iwaga, na karpe cunihin. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Nga̱ bu'a buna busa Samariya buba kure icugo i miya, kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ni panya miya na so.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Silmajiri si bware si kure i'ogo asa sa mare). <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Kwa bu'a buna busa Basamariya na cane Yesu, neya goo buna busa Bayahude bui na kaba miya ma iso, gya hinda bu'a bu Samariya?&gt;&gt; (Zwama Hayahudawa hai rewa mare na hakwano hana Hasamariyawa aba re mare naba.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Kwa Yesu na cane bo, &lt;&lt;Si bu daki daje u Hwinsu hina na buco buna bu kaba miya iso, bui kaba bware hinda bware bui pa miya ma a̱huru ana aza ihogu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Kwa bu'a bu cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; Buza uguga goo bui nume miya zwama iwaga i zwamuci. Humba goo bui hyan miya ma a̱huru? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Bu zake buca a buci Yakub, ana aci pa iwaga hinda bu so miya bai ba, na saawo na hamuga na hatamiya ko bu hyan nga̱ bu zake Yakub?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Buna bu so miya mana bui gupa i hogi cu'oi, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />ama buna bu so miya mana ma gya na pan bu za ihogi cu'oi. kamahinda, miya mana ma gya na pan bo mai san miya ma a̱huru ana aza ihogu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Bu'a kwa na hyen na bware, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ buyaba, na panya miya mani nga̱ gya na za ihogi cu'oinya hinda na za i kola kana icogo i miya piniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Kwa Yesu na hyen na buba,&gt;&gt; Ala, uganya bware a buboi i korya na boba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Kwa buba na hyen, &lt;&lt;Na za bware.&gt;&gt; Yesu a hyen na boba, &lt;&lt;Yesu a hyen bui magalaganuwo nga̱ go bu hyen na za bware. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kamahinda, bu i sare sa ta, hinda bware buna goo bu za bui sa bware abubuya. Ina goo zwame usa kamahinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Bu'a bu cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na hyan busa Bucubago bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Hacaco a haci ha cinge ci Samariya a pa Hwinsu cilabe pa mu'ogo a muna, ama ganhin Hayahudawa i hyan an ihuga ina aba ai pan Hwinsu cilabe isa na Urshalima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Kwa Yesu na cane bo, &lt;&lt;Bu'a buna, tani soo na gya, hon yiwa na korwo una aco aza pan Buca̱ cilabe na mu'ogo muna ko na Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />ga̱hi Hasamariyawa i yiwa na pan cilabe na ina ga̱hi i dakuwo; gaci Hayahudawa ciyiwa na pan ina gaci daki cilabe, zwama icagago i sirya pa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ama hun yiwa na kurya hon aco na ai pan Hwinsu cilabe ci kamahinda ai pan own cilabe na a̱huru a burya̠ na kamahinda, zwama abe asa iri aco na ai pana cilabe cina ci Buca̱ uba ginbo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Hwinsu usa a̱huru a burya̠, hinda aco na ginbo i pan own cilabe dole a pan own cilabe na a̱huru a burya̠ na kamahinda <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Kwa bu'a na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Na daki buna aba ogo Bucagagu Almasihu&gt;&gt; (buna aba og Kristi) a yiwa na korwo. Si a kurya, ai ci zwaman tibai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu kwa na zwaman bo, &lt;&lt;Gya buna na yiwa na cikarigo na goo gyamui buna bu goo bu rubi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Aba na hoga cikarigo kwa silmajiri si bware na maringe hinda mamaki ma konbe sa nga̱ aba bange bware na cikarigo na bu'a. Ama a nagi buna bwe kabana bwa, &lt;&lt;Bai goo bu ginbo?&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;Bai goo bu yiwa na karigyaga na buba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Kwa bu'a na curya utako u miya, na ia̱man monda suwa wui i'ogo kwa na hin na aco, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Kurya je, i hin buco buna na zwama ina gya na ia̱ hal ho na aba na mace. Ko uma ia̱ abe asa Bucagagu Kristi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Kwa aco na sere na suwa i'ogo a kore pa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Aba na haruni kwa silmajiri si bware na hin, &lt;&lt;Walami, ere mare.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ama Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Na za mare ma gya na re man ga̱hi i dakuwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Kwa silmajiri na ma zwamana, &lt;&lt;Ko buciyahya bu kulage bware mare?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Kwa Yesu na hyen, &lt;&lt;Mare a mamui,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ia̠ ibwana buna bwa na cuma hinda hogi ibwana buna bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Iza na zwamaga a gane pyana nasi a ia̱ guba&gt;? Na zwama, gunja haisa i byane enta! Ha dwubo guba. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Ko bane buco bu guba bu yiwa na hyan daje, bu yiwa na tanagana mare kuro a̱huru ana aza ihogu, zwama na buna bu yiwa na guba na buna bu yiwa na cikaba a hoge laco ka̱mu waba. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kamahinda u cikarigo cina ci hyen &lt;Buco buika bu kabe bucage bu gubi&gt; cisa kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Na cuma i gubi ina ga̱hi iwo ibwana iba. Acage aco ia̱ ibwana, hinda ga̱hi i gubi daje u wahala waba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hasamariyawa dinya ha tana soo na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Aco Samariya denya a tani soo na Yesu zwama cikarigo cina bu'a buba zwama ga, &lt;&lt;Buna zwama ina gya ia̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Nga̱ aco Samariya aba a kore pa Yesu, kwa aba na hin na bware bu madale pa ba, bu madale pa ba mohon murya. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Aco dinyana Samariya a tana soo na Yesu zwama cikarigo ci Bware. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Kwa aco Samariya na hin na bu'a, &lt;&lt;Baniya ci tani soo sa zwama gaci hoge pa go; ama baniya ci hogo na sicwa a sici, hinda ci dako buco buna busa Bucagago doone bu Kamahinda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume bwa bu buco bulabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Nga̱ mohon murya muba i Yesu a curi Samariya kuro u Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(Yesu a tabe zwamage an acubago a Hwinsu za maka̠la̠ na cinge ca ba.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Nga̱ Yesu aba wuci Galili, aco Galili a gice bware na wawo. An hyan ka̱mu ina bware buba ia̱ na Urshalima hon lago ui kacikago, zwama aco Galili a yanse payi. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kwa Yesu na gopa i kore i'ogo i Ka'ana na Galili, ihuga ina bware buba ringe miya masa miya ma inabi. Hinda payi azase igwamgwama ina bwa bui ba bu labuce bui hogo laco na Kaparnahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Nga̱ igwamgwama iba hoge an Yesu a marengewa Yahudiya kurwo Galili, kwa buba na kore pa Yesu na kaba̱ a kore a hwingacume bwa bu buba na Kaparnahum, buna bu ka̱ri i kwaji. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;ga̱hi si i tani soo i mamaki na alama,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Iza yaje.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Igwamgwam kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, kurya yaba numui kapi bwa a bumui bu kwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu a cane bo, &lt;&lt;Ala, bwa bubui bu za kwaji.&gt;&gt; buco buna bu tani soo na cikarigo ci Yesu kwa na mawalan <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Igwamgwam iba na yina kurwo u yaba, kwa agyama buba na jubaga na buba kwa na zwamana bo bwa a bubo bu hwinga. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nga̱ buba kaba̱ lokaci una bwa buba bu hwingu, kwa aba na hyen na buba, &lt;&lt;Na hun na icwa mahona maba curi bo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Kwa buca bu bwa na mabuturyge lokaci buni Yesu aba zwama bo, &lt;&lt;Ala bwa abubui bui hwinge.&gt;&gt; Kwa igwamgwama na aco yaba i ba ka̱mu na tani soo na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ini isa i mamaki na lagi bini na Yesu aba ia̱gi, i curi i Bware Yahudiya kurwo u Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume bugunu na uhyanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Wa ssanuwo, Yesu a kore Urshalima zwama lago u Hayahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Na Urshalima aza iwaga, ina aba ringa na hazak ha ta, na are a Cihiburu ha ogo Betasda. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Sa labutage aco mahona dinya na hazak-ruba, gunu, aco mahona ma amaci. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Sa a̱pa lokaci-una acuma sa ese abunjigi miya. Ka̱mu buna bu zwalagi matana na suwa miya mahona ma buba masa ma curi bo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Buco buna bu yanse payi bu ia̱ haya kope hataco na utataco buba na mahona. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hyan bo hinda a hoge na bu sano na mahona, kwa Yesu na kaban bo, &lt;&lt;Bu ka̱ri a bu hwingacume?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Buco bu mahona bu cane, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na za buna bu na zangaca bu na tane soo iwaga sa acuma a bunjigi miya. Sa na ka̱ri ese na miya sa na zolagi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Kwa Yesu na hyen na buco bu mahona, &lt;&lt;Masenge! Zangaci cibaro a ci bo jabage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />A sanuwo mahona ma buba ma hwenge; bu zangi cibaro ci buba kwa na jabaga. A ia̱gi ini hon ihupacu u hayahudawa, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />zwama haruni Hayahudawa kwa na hin buna aba hwingacume, &lt;&lt;Usa hon ihupacu u Hayahudawa, icibago i Musa gazi go zangi cibaro a cibuya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Kwa buco bu mahona na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Buco buna hwingacume bu hyen na gya, &lt;Zanga cibaro a ci buya jabage.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Kwa aba na kaban bo, &lt;&lt;Ganba buna bu hin nago zang i cihano?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Buna aba hwingacume bwe dakuwo buna bu hwingacume bo, zwama Yesu a ma huri pa aco na matanaga ali. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />A sanuwo Yesu a hyan bo na iginga i labe kwa na hyen na buba, &lt;&lt;Byana, goo a buna bu hugo laco hinda. Curya ia̱ga magwata̱ ko hinda mahona man ma zake mana ma bo konbe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kwa buco buni na kore zwamana Hayahudawa an Yesu abe a hwingacume bo.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anhurun pa bwa bu Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Zwama haruni, a hina na dama Yesu zwama a ia̱gi ini hon ihupacu u hayahudawa, hayahudawa ka̱ri i hone Bware. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bumui bu yiwa na ibwana hal baniya, Gya, hinda, na yiwa na ibwana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Zwama cikarigo ci Yesu aba ia̱ hayahudawa ha ginbage ha hone Bware; sa zwama buba bui laganowa hon ihupacu u hayahudawa, ama bu uga Hwinsu Buca̱ bu buba, bu hyen aba na Hwinsu asa bwekan. <verse eid="JHN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Kwa Yesu na cane ga na hin; &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, Bwa bu Hwinsu bu za i ia̱ ihya na icwa i buba; bui kawai ina buba hyan Buca̱ bu buba na ia̱ga, zwama ina Buca̱ buba ia̱gu ka̱mu bu bui ia̱ga. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Zwama Buca̱ bu ka̱ri bwa hinda bui ciba bo ina buba ia̱gu. Harbuni, hal ma bui ciba bo ibwana ina i zake ini zwama ai pa mamaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Nga̱ Buca̱ buba wasingoo aco na a kwaji hinda bu pan ga a̱huru, harbuni hinda Bwa sa pan a̱huru pa buna bua ka̱ri. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Harbuni, Buca̱ buza ia̱gya buciyahya shara'a, ama bu pan bwa bu buba koce bu ia̱ shara'a, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />zwama aco ka̱mu a pan bwa cilabe nga̱ aba sa pan Buca̱. Buna bwa panuwa bwa cilabe bwa panuwa Buca̱ cilabe, buna cu cuma bo. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Kamahinda na zwama, buna bu hoge cikarigo a cimui hinda bu tani soo na buna bo na cuma bui hyan a̱huru ana aza ihogu hinda aza ia̱gi bo shara'a; bu kaciwo u'o kuro a̱huru. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Kamahinda na zwama, hon yiwa na korwo hinda u kurwo ma baniya una aco a kwajo ai hwinge cikarigo ci Bwa bu Hwinsu hinda aco na hoge aza ikwaji. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Nga̱ Buca̱ uba za a̱huru na icwa i ba, harbuni hinda uba pan bwa a̱huru ai icwa i buba. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Hinda u pan bwa bu koce bu ia̱ shara'a zwama buba sa Bwa bu Buwama. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Ita hoga mamaki u cikarigo ciniyo, zwama hon yiwa na korwo aco na yiwa na suwa u hazi haba ai hoge cikarigo cini <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />hinda a sire na izi na aco na ia̱ i burya̠ ata kwada, hinda aco na ia̱ eewo ai masenga zwama a hune ga. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Na icwa namui na pwanuwa ia̱ ihya; Si ia̱ shara'a nga̱ Hwinsu uba hyen an gya ia̱, zwama shara'a nimui usa kamahinda, na za ne lagana maka̠la̠ ma icwa nimui ama buna bwa na cuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">seda u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Sa na ia̱gi icwa nimui sheda, sheda nimui ui sa u kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ama aza buna bu yiwa na ia̱ seda zwama gya, hinda na daki seda una buba yiwa na ia̱gya usa u kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />&lt;&lt;I cuma aco pa Yohana iba hinda i zwama kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ka̱mu na haruni na yajuwa na seda u Buca̱, ama na zwame zwama ga̱hi i caga. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana a sase apicila na aba kati a pan cingero, hinda i tanga i ia̱ wawo na cingero u bware. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Ama na za seda ui icwa nmui una u zake una u Yohana aba ia̱ zwama gya. ibwana ina gya na ia̱gu isa ina Buca̱ a bumui buba na pan gya ia̱, ube usa seda an Buca̱ a bumui bube bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Buca̱ abumui buna bo na cuma bube na icwa i buba busa sheda nimui. I sa huguwa bicwaro bi buba ko nga̱ buba nyaga, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ko cikarigo ci buba ci ma daluwa na hasuwa a hahin, zwama i taniwa soo na buna uba u cuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />I yiwa na byangana cikarigo ci Hwinsu zwama i hyan ingana i a̱huru ana aza ihogu. Cikarigo ci Hwinsu a cini cina ci pan seda numui, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ama ka̱mu na haruni i wonje kurya ahwamui i hyin a̱huru. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;Na cyaga izangacu ya aco, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />ama na budaki. Na daki iza maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu na hasoo ahahi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Na kuri na ize i Buca̱ a bumui, hinda ini cewa; ama si cagiya buco bu kuri na eze i buba, i cya bo. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Neya ga̱hi i tani soo si iyiwa na cya izangacu ya aco pa sicwa asihin, ka̱mu na haruni ia̱ji kokari i hin izangacu ini ya sirya pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;Ita ungana ana na kula kara pa Buca̱ abumui. Buna bui kula kara bube busa Musa una u ga̠hi tani soo naba. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Si i tani soo na Musa, i yaji na gya, zwama bware bu i cikarigo zwama gya. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ama si i taniwa soo na ina bware buba rubuci, niya ga̠hi i tani soo na cikarigo acimui?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a ryacume aco dubu uta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Na ihogu ini, Yesu a kace uwo u Galili (wata, uwo u Tibariya), <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />upugo wa aco u laga Bware zwama a hyan i mamaki ina aba hyan buba egyi pa aco mahona. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Kwa Yesu na danje zata i'ogo kwa na madala na silmajiri sa bware. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Lago ui kacigago u hayahudawa u yabutano. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Nga̱ Yesu aba byane zata a hyan aco upugo matanaga na kore pa bware, kwa bware na hin na Filibus, &lt;&lt;Hunba gaci ci hin mare man mai dwube upugu wa aco na a re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu a kaba Filibus zwama a gwaji bware, zwama bware bu daki na soo u buba ina buba bui ia̱ga. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibus a cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ko musare muna mu ilebura aba ai cupe mu pyana utataco sa san mare maza i jube tiganba bu hin cimu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Kwa acage almajiri ana aba ogo Andarawus, buhunwo bu Saminu Bitrus, a hin, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Bwa hya a buna na haburodi hata murege mugico murya̱, ama bai muba mui ia̱gya aco upugu na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Zwamana aco a madale.&gt;&gt; Ihuga i za humbe dinya, kwa aco na madala, aco wuci dubu uta. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu kwa na zangaci haburodi hani, kwa na pan Hwinsu cilabe, kwa na pan aco na madalage nga̱ burodi uba ui jube ga. Kwa Bware na ia̱ na murege nga̱ buba i na burodi. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Nga̱ tiganba buba re bu sigi, kwa Yesu na hyen na silmajiri sa buba, &lt;&lt;Tanagana mukinda muna mu gane. Ita curya ihya i ma hacigage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />A tanaga mukinda kwa na sinji mutasu ikope na murya mu burodi u ta muna aco ba re gane. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Nga̱ aco ba hyan i mamaki ina Yesu aba ia̱, kwa aba na hyen, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda acubago a Hwinsu bana ana a yiwa na korwo na doone.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu, nga̱ aba daki an a yiwa na ginbo a sa bware busa bugwama na koce, kwa bware na mahula ai dakuwo na ala zata u i'ogo. <verse eid="JHN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nga̱ uyinbe uba i, kwa silmajiri si Yesu na ala uwo, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />a ese na suwa u jirigi u miya noya u miya na kaca suwa uwo korwa u kaparnahum. Hal uyinbe u i Yesu a kurwo pa silmajiri sa bware. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kwa uwo na hinana apisa zwama mupyala mu koce mu masenge na wo. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Nga̱ silmajiri siba i tuki u jirigi u miya merwa misali u mil ataco ko ataco na rabi kwa aba na hyan Yesu na jabaga zata u miya, kwa silmajiri na hyan Yesu na kore pa jirigi miya wab, kwa iwasa na konbe ga. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kwa Yesu na hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Gyamui!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Kwa aba na yaje Yesu a ese na suwa u jirigi u miya waba, a sanuwo kwa aba na wuci ugagi ni kure ihuga ina ka̱ri kurwo.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco ginbage Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba bonge aco na matanaga ukacaso u wo a daki an jirigi u miya u yanse uikan, hinda Yesu a esuwa na silmajiri si bware, ama si ali siba-siba. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Aza hajirigi ha miya ha noya han ha sirya Tibariya ha yinsa ciyabu na ihuga ina aco ba re burodi nga̱ Buca̱ bu yaba aba ia̱gi Hwinsu gojiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Nga̱ aco ba hyan Yesu na silmajiri aza payi, kwa aba na ese hajirigi ha miya kurwa u kaparnahum na gibo u Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abe asa burodi a a̱huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Nga̱ aba hyan bware na ukacaso u wo, a kaba bware,&lt;&lt;Walami, binba goo bu wuci piniyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, i yiwa na ginbo nimui sa zwama ga̱hi hyan i mamaki, ama zwama ga̱hi i re burodi i sigi. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />I ta ia̱ ibwana na ginbo mare mana mai ma hacigaga, ama ginbaga mare mana mai sana i hin a̱huru ana aza ihogu, mana bwa bu Hwinsu bui pan. Zwama pa Bwa bu buwama Hwinsu Buca̱ uba riganu tana sheda u alama a cibe Hwinsu u yaji na bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kwa aba na kaban bware, &lt;&lt;Bai gaci ia̱ zwama ci ia̱ ibwana ina Hwinsu uba ginbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ina Hwinsu ub ginbo i tani soo na buna uba wa cuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Kwa aba na kaban bware, &lt;&lt;Umba i mamaki goo bui ci ciba gaci ci hyan tani soo? Bai goo bui ia̱? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ha kaka a haci ha re manna na hilo; nga̱ aba rubuci: &lt;A pana ga burodi na zaro a re.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu an hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, sa Musa ube u pan sikaka burodi na hilo na zaro, ama Buca̱ a bumui buna buyiwa na zaro buna pangano burodi u kamahinda na zaro. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Zwama burodi u Hwinsu usa buna bwa kanzigi zata u zaro hinda bu pan aco doone a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />A kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tohonba ci pan burodi uni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Kwa Yesu cane, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa burodi u a̱huru,&gt;&gt; ka̱mu buna bu kurya pa gya buze hi huge imero, aco na a tani soo na gya hinda buza i huge ci'unya. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ama nga̱ gya na i zwama, ina gya hal baniya i taniwa soo na gya. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Ina Buca̱ a bumui buba na pan i kore a pamui, hinda ka̱mu buna bo kore a pamui na za i ance bwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Zwama na kanzigi na zaro sa gya ia̱gi ina gya na genbo ama ina Buca̱ a bumui na zaro buna bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ina Buca̱ buna bwa na cuma buba ginbo bina, an gya ta naga ka̱mu buna buba na pan, ama asenge ga ka̱mu hon kundagu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ina Buca̱ a bumui buba ginbo an ka̱mu buna bu byani bwa bu ba hina bu tani soo na buba bui hyan na a̱huru ana aza ihogu, hinda ui masenga bwa hon kacuta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Hayahudawa ha hina hawongoro hab hoge Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa burodi una u sire zata u zaro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Kwa hab na hin, &lt;&lt;Sa Yesu bina ba, bwa bu Yusuf, buna buca na amaci gaci daki? Neya buba hyen baniya, &lt;Na sirya na zaro&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Cure hawongoro na sicwa sihin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Aza buna bui kore pa gya kwa Buca̱ buna bwa na cuma bu kaji bo a pamui, hinda gya na masenga bo hon kacuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nga̱ aba rubuci na hatakada ha Acubago a Hwinsu: &lt;Hwinsu ui cibaga ga aco ka̱mu.&gt; Ka̱mu buna bu kubli ina Buca̱ buba zwamago hinda bu koyi bui kore a pamui. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Aza buna bo hyano Buca̱ kwa buna bwa sirya pa Hwinsu; bu be bwa tabo hyan Buca̱. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kamahinda na zwama, buna bu tana soo bui hyan a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Gyamui na sa burodi mana mazi a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Si kaka sihin sa re manna na hilo, ka̱mu na haruni a kwadagi. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ama burodi una u sire na zaro, una Buca̱ bo re bu za ikwaji. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Gyamui na sa burodi una usire na zaro. Ka̱mu buna bu re burodi mana, bui hyan a̱huru ana za ihogu. Hinda burodi niya una gya nabu pan masa inigwa na ikanga nimu, zwama aco doone a hin a̱huru ana iza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Kwa hayahudawa na hinan masesa ma abobo, &lt;&lt;Niya Buca̱ ni ui ci pa inigwa i ikanga i buba hinda gaci re. <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu a hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, kwa i re munegwa mu Bwa bu Buwama hinda i so mahyan ma buba, iza a̱huru na ikanga na hin. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Buna bu re munegwa mu ikanga amamui hinda bu so mahya amamui bui yan na a̱huru ana aza ihogu, na yasenga bo hon kacuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Munegwa mu ikanga amamui mu sa mare kamahinda hinda mahya amamui masa i ci so kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ka̱mu buna bu re munigwa mu ikanga na mahya amamui bui yana na gya, Gya hinda na aba. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Nga̱ Buca̱ buna bu yiwa bu na cuma zwama bu be gya na yiwa, harbuni hinda buna bu sa gya na sa mare ma buba bu za kwaji zwama gya. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Gyamui nasa mare ma kamahinda mana ma sere na zaro. Sikaka a sihin si re manna na hila si kwaji, ama buna bu re ikanga nimu nga̱ mare bu za kwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu a zwamage haruni aba na cibaga na muginga mu labe na Kaparnahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alagano dinya sa curi ilagana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Nga̱ silagano siba hoge haruni, silmajiri sa Yesu dinya kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Cikarigo cini ci gagome hal ga̱hi san kacutu. Ganba bui pwana yaje na ciba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Nga̱ Yesu a daki an silmajiri sa yiwa na hawongoro zwama cikarigo aba ia̱, kwa buba na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ini i hacigage soo? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Neya sa ihyan bwa bu Buwama na yidana zata ihuga ina buba yanse! <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ahuru a Hwinsu ai pan a̱huru; ikanga i aco iza koce u ihya. Cikarigo ci gya na egyi cisa a̱huru a burya̠ hinda cisa a̱huru. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ama aza cagiya aco na ai taniwa soo na ciba.&gt;&gt; Zwama tun na jigo Yesu a daki aco na ai taniwa soo na cikarigo ci Bware na hinda buna bui cutan Bware. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kwa Yesu na jidana hin, &lt;&lt;Ube u san gya na hin na ga̱hi aza buna bo korya a pamui kwa Buca̱ bumui bu pan bwa koce.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Zwama haruni, alagano a Yesu dinya na a marenge kacuta hinda a wonje i lagana bware. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu a kaba silmajiri ikope na sirya, &lt;&lt;ga̱hi ma i ginbo ala.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Saminu Bitrus a cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, pa ganba gaci ci kore? Gabui bu za cikarigo ci a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Gaci ci tani soo hinda ci daki goo busa bu nagu ciri buna bwa sire pa Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Kwa Yesu na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Sa gyamui na tanga, aco ikope na burya̠? Ama ka̱mu na haruni Buca̱ buika busa bugwama bu eewo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Nupi a Yesu Yahuda, bwa bu Saminu Iskariyoti, buna, ko nga̱ buba sa ikope na burya̠ ima ringe i cuta bware.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na anhunwo bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Nga̱ ini iba i ka̱mu, Yesu a ringi suwa u cinge Galili, bwe yajuwa bu ese suwa u Yahudiya zwama alabe Hayahudawa ha yiwa na ginbo ha hone bware. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ama lago u Hazak u Hayahudawa yabutano, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />anhuwo Yesu a hyen na Bware, &lt;&lt;U gyamace go curi pini ali Yahudiya nga̱ silmajiri a sibo si hyan i mamaki na go bui ia̱. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Aza buna bu ginbo a daki na buba hinda bu i ibwana i buba na ciswin. Nga̱ go buyiwa na ia̱ga ina, ciba icwa nubui zwama aco doone u bu daki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ko ahun Yesu ai tanuwa soo na Bware. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Kwa Yesu na cane naba, &lt;&lt;Lokaci numui ai sa kurya; ama pa ganhin tunba lokaci u yiwa harbuni. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />ga̱hi doone u za ne wonje, ama gya ui na wonje zwamage iwo aba ia̱gu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />ga̱in ala kurwa u lago. Gya na za i kore baniya, zwama gya lokaci ui sa korya baniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni, kwa aba na madala na Galili. <verse eid="JHN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ama, nga̱ ahun Yesu aba ali lago, bware hinda bu kore, ama bwe ma hyagiwo, ama na ciswin. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />pa lago alebe Hayahudawa ha hina iginbaga bware na makaba, &lt;&lt;Buco buciya bu yiwa hunba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Pa aco na matanaga a hina makargyagana. Acage aco a hyen, &lt;&lt;Bware busa buco burya̠.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ama aza buna bwa sirya bu i cikarigo ci wo zwama iwasa i Hayahudawa.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a cibage hon lago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Nga̱ aba wuci rabi u lokaci aba na lago kwa Yesu na ese suwa u iginga a hina icibago. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Hayahudawa ha hoge mamaki kwa na kabana, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bwe sa tabuwa i kore makaranta hunba buba hin cidaka haruni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Icibago numui i sa nimui. I sirya pa Hwinsu buna bu na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ka̱mu buna bu tanga bu i ina Hwinsu uba ginbo, bwe daki ko icibago numui isa i Hwinsu, sa naumui. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Buna bu i cikarigo ci icwa i buba, ama buna i ibwana zwama izangacu i buna bwa cuma bo busa buco kamahinda, aza i cibya na buba. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Sa Musa ube ui pan icibago i Hwinsu? Ama ko buco bweka bwe lagano icibago i Musa. Bai sa ganhin i ginbo na hona?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Aco na matanaga a cane, &lt;&lt;I sa aco mupyala mu eewo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu a cani aco na matanaga, &lt;&lt;Na ia̱ i mamaki bikan, hinda ka̱mu nuhi i hoge mamaki. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ko Nga̱ uba sa, Musa u hyan ai ia̱gi kaciya (ama sa Musa ube u rwage, ama u rwage pa sikaka a sici) ka̱mu na haruni si ia̱gi saawo kaciya hon ihupacu u Hayahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Baniya sa ia̱gi bwa kaciya hon ihupacu u hayahudawa zwama ata kacika icibago i Musa, bai san ga̱hi i hacigage soo na gya zwama gya na hwingacume buco mahona hon ihupacu u hayahudawa? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Ita ia̱ shara'a na muhyanu mu haisa, ama ia̱ga shara'a u kamahinda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asa Masihu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Kwa aco Urshalima na rwaga makaba, &lt;&lt;Sa buco buna alabe a Hayahudawa ginbo ihone a buna? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Bware a buna na ia̱ cikarigo pa aco, hinda ai cane bware ko na ihya. Ko aco alabe a Hayahudawa a yaje an Kamahinda bube bu sa Kristi Bucagagu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ama ci daki pa buco buna buba yiwa; sa Kristi a kore, aza buna bui daki ihuga ina aba a sirya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu aba na cibaga na suwa iginga, kwa na ia̱ cikarigo na koce na hin, &lt;&lt;Harbuni, i na daki, hinda i daki ihuga ina i gya na yiwa. Na za pini zwama icwa nimui, ama buna bwa na cuma busa bu kamahinda. I dakuwo bo, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />ama gya na daki bwa zwama na sirya pa buba hinda bube bwa na cuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Nga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni kwa alabe a Hayahudawa ka̱ri i konbe bware, ama aza buna bu kole wa na ginbo i konbe bware, zwama lokaci wa ikonbo i bware wa iwo <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ama ka̱mu na haruni, aco upugo dinya a tani soo na bware. Kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Sa Kristi a kore, ai ia̱ga i mamaki ina zake ina bware buba ia̱gi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Acuma musoja a konbe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Haparisiyawa ha hoge aco na makublagana cikarigo ci Yesu, kwa alabe labe na cuma aco na yiwa na anpe ui iginga a konbya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Kwa Yesu na cane na hin, &lt;&lt;Lokaci una gya na yana na ga̱hi usa cimu, hinda gya maringe pa buna bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />I na ginbaga, ama iza na hyana; hinda ihuga ina i gya na yiwa, iza pwana korwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Kwa alabe Hayahudawa na ma zwaman, &lt;&lt;Honba buco buna buba ka̱ri ikore gaci ci za ipwana ha̱n bo? ko bu ka̱ri ikore ihuga ina i hayahudawa hab magatgage hab madale na hahelenawa, hinda ha cibage hahelenawa payi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Baiya buba ginbo i hyen buba hin, &lt;I na ginbaga, ama iza na hyana,&gt; hinda &lt;Ihuga ina gya na yiwa, i za pwana korwa&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alkawali a miya ma a̱huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Hon i kundagu u lago una usa u labe, Yesu a masinge kwa na ia̱ cikarigo na koce, &lt;&lt;Sa aza buna bu hoge cu'oi, bu kurya a pamui bu so. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na gya, nga̱ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zamage, ujaba u miya ma a̱huru mai sirya na suwa u buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ina yesu aba ginbo i zwame, a̱huru a Hwinsu, ana aco na tani soo na bware aba ai ca. Zwama lokaci uni ai sa cumane na a̱huru a burya̠, zwama ai sa cilabe Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hapsagu a icwa i aco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Nga̱ aco ba hoge cikarigo cina ci Yesu aba zwame, kwa aco na hin, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda buco buna busa Acubago a Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Acagiya a hin, &lt;&lt;Bware busa Kristi.&gt;&gt; Ama cagiya a kaba, &lt;&lt;Neya Kristi aba ai sirya pa cinge ci Galili? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Sa cikarigo ci Hwinsu cibe ci zwamage an Kristi ai sirya na azwaga a Dauda hinda na Baitalami, na i'ogo ina Bugwama Dauda aba yiwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Zwama haruni kwa hasuwa ha aco na mahabsag cirya zwama Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Acagiya a konbe bware, ama aza buna bu dangai bware.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nagu ui tani soo u hayahudawa ha labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Nga̱ aco na yiwa na anpe u iginga maringe alabe labe na haparisiyawa, ha kaba ga, &lt;&lt;Bai sa ga̱hi i kuleya bware pini?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Aco anpe cane, &lt;&lt;Aza buna tabe ia̱ cikarigo nga̱ buco buna buba ia̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Kwa haparisiyawa na hin na aco anpe u iginga, &lt;&lt;ga̱hi ma Yesu bu ia̱gu uno u laco?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Aza mugwamgwam ko Haparisiyawa hana ha tani soo na bware? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Aye, Ama aco upugo na ai dakuwo ina i yiwa na icibago i Musa a tane ga uno uwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodimos, ana kore sa pa Yesu aba ma a yanse naba, a kaba, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ko icibago nici i yaje a hone buco kaza aba ia̱gi bwa makaba ma lagiyo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />A cane, &lt;&lt;Go busa bu Galili, ka̱mu? Byana in ha̱n, hinda i daki an bucubago bu Hwinsu aza i sirya na Galili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kwa aba na ala yaba.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Bu'a buna aba kumbe na cidana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ama Yesu a kore zata a'ogo a e'on zaitun. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Na ubungwa ma'enta Yesu a gope ese iginga, ihuga ina aco ba matanaga pa bware, hinda bu ma dale icibago yaba. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Kwa hawalami icibago i Musa na Haparisiyawa na kole bu'a aba konbe na cidana. A san bo bu yinsa na usa waba <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />kwa na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami, bu'a buna ci konbe bwa na usa u cidana. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Na icibago i Musa a yaje bwage bo na hatare. Baniya baiya go bu hin?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />A ia̱gi Yesu makaba mani zwama a gwaji bware, nga̱ aba ai hyan yina aba ai konbe bware. Ama Yesu a kuzaci kwa na ia̱ cihenro na ibwabwa na cinge. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Nga̱ aba hina ia̱gya Yesu makaba, kwa bware na masinga na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Sa az buna bu za magwata̱, bu rwage ita bo na tare.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kwa Yesu na gopa ikuzat na ia̱ cihenro na cinge. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Nga̱ aba hoge haruni, kwa aba na rwaga i ala bweka na bweka, dag aco labe kurwo aco noya, kwa aba na curya Yesu, na bu'a buni a yisinga payi. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu a masenge kwa na kaban bu'a buni, &lt;&lt;Bu'a, a yiwa hunba? Aza buna bu hune?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Bu cane, &lt;&lt;Aye, Buca̱ bu yaba.&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane bo, &lt;&lt;Gya ma na za na bu huna,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ala ta ia̱kana magwata̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asa cingero u doone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu a jidane ia̱ cikarigo na aco, a hin, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa cingero u doone. Buna bu na laga buza jabaga na ci'incu, ama bui hyan a̱huru a cingero.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bu yiwa na ia̱gya icwa na bo sheda; hinda shaida no boi u sa u kamahinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ko si na ia̱gi icwa nimui shaida, ai shaida nimui usa u kamahinda, zwama na daki pa gya na sirya na hinda ihuga ina gya na kore. Ama ga̱hi i dakuwo ihuga ina gya na sirya na ihuga ina gya na ginbo i kore <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />ga̱hi i yiwa na ia̱ shara'a pa ihyanu buco; gya na za na ia̱gya buciyahya shara'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ama ko na ka̱ri ia̱ shara'a, shara'a asimu sisa kamahinda, zwama na za gya. Na yiwa na Buca̱ a bumui buna bu na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Na icibago nihin an hin sa hin ha sheda harya ha zwame i bikan usa u kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Gyamui na yiwa na pan sheda u icwa nimui; Buca̱ buna, bo cuma bube busa bu lagi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Kwa aba na kaban Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ a bubo bu yiwa honba?&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;I na dakuwo ko Buca̱ a bumui.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Si na daki i daki Buca̱ a bumui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu a i icibago na suwa u iginga na suwa ukaba na aba ili sadaka ciyabu na ihuga ina aba pan Hwinsu daje. Ai hinwo buna bu konbe Bware, zwama lokaci u ikonbo i bware i wuce.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihuga na gya ni kure iza pa kure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu a jidane i hin naba, &lt;&lt;Na ginbo i ala, hinda i na ginbaga, hinda i kwaji na magwata̱ ma hin. Ihuga ina gya na kore, i za pwana korwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Nga̱ hayahudawa hab hoge haruni ha kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Bui ma hona? Ube u san buba hin, &lt;Ihuga ina gya na genbo kore, i za korya&gt;? &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Kwa Yesu na jidana hin, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi i sirya imya; Gya na sirya zata. I sa aco doone; Gya na sa bu doone. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ni zwama an i koji na magwata̱ mahin; si i taniwa soo gya na sa buna bu gya na hin na sa, i kwaji kamahinda na magwata̱ mahin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />A kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Go busa ganba?&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ina gya na yiwa na zwamaga an na sa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />&lt;&lt;Aza i dinya gya na ginbo na zwame ga̱hi, i dinya gya bu ia̱ shara'a Ama buna bwa cuma busa kamahinda, hinda ina gya na hoge pa Hwinsu na zwama doone.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Aco ai dakuwo an Yesu a ia̱gi ga cikarigo na Buca̱ bu bware. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ube u san Yesu a ia̱gi ga cikarigo na hin, &lt;&lt;Si bu dande bwa bu Buwama, bui daki an na sa ina gya na zwamage ina gya na sa hinda aza ina gya na ia̱gu na icwa nimui ama na zwamago ka̱mu ina Buca̱ bumu bu na cibago. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Buna bwa na cuma bu yiwa tare na gya, bui na curiwo gya, zwama na ia̱gu ina si sana bu hoge laco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Lokaci una Yesu aba na cikarigo cini aco dinya a tana soo bware.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agyama na aco na asawa agyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Kwa Yesu na hin, na hayahudawa hana ha tani soo na bware, &lt;&lt;Sa i kumgage icibago nimui, i sana alagano nimui a kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Na haruni i daki kamahinda, hinda kamahinda ui sana a bu curi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Kwa aba na cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gaci ci sa azwaga a Ibrahim hinda ci sa tabuwa i sana bugyama bu buciyahya. Neya go bui hyen an ai ci curya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, buna bu ia̱ magwata̱ busa bugyama bu magwata̱. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Baniya bugyama buza ihuga i dala na yaba, ama bwa busa bu yaba na za ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Sa bwa bu curi, ai bu curya kamahinda <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Na daki i sa azwaga a Ibrahim. Ka̱mu na haruni i ginbo na hona, zwama i cewa cikarigo a cimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Na i zwama ina gya na hyan pa Buca̱ bumui, hinda i yiwa na ia̱ga ina ga̱hi i hoge pa buca a buhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />A cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim isa buca a buci.&gt;&gt; Yesu hyen, &lt;&lt;Si yasa saawo sa Ibrahim,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ya ia̱ga ina Ibrahim iba ia̱gi. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Zwama gya na zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci kamahinda, ube u ga̱hi na hona. Ibrahim i ia̱guwo iri ini. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />I ia̱gu ina Buca̱ buhin buba ia̱gi.&gt;&gt; Hayahudawa ha cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gaci ci sa saawo mana aba maci na cidana.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Buca̱ buna gaci za Hwinsu kawai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu a hin naba, sa Hwinsu ube usa Buca̱ buhin ya na ka̱la̱, zwama na sirya pa Hwinsu hinda gyamui a buna pini. Na kurya zwama icwa nimui; ama buna cuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Bai san ga̱hi i ganewa cikarigo a cimui? Zwama i huguwa ina gya na hin. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />I sa bu Buca̱ buhin, bugwama bu eewo, hinda i ginbo i ia̱g ina Buca̱ buhin buba ginbo. Busa buna bu ka̱ri ihono tun na jigu, bui komgaguwa i kamahinda, zwama aza cikarigo ci kamahinda na buba. Sa bu ia̱ cibya, bu karigyage na cikarigo yaba ya ba, zwama bu zwamago cibya hinda busa Buca̱ bu cibya. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ka̱mu na haruni zwama gya na zwamago kamahinda, i taniwa soo na gya! <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ganba bui na zwamana magwata̱ na gya na ia̱? Sa ina gya na zwamage sa kamahinda, bai san ga̱in i taniwa soo na gya? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Buna bu sa bu Hwinsu bui hoge ina Hwinsu uba hin. Ina san ga̱hi i huguwa zwama i sa bu Hwinsu.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Hayahudawa ha cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ashe sa kamahinda gaci zwame an busa buco bu Samariya buna buza mupyala mu eewo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Na za mupyala mu eewo&gt;&gt; Ama na pano Buca̱ bumui cilabe ga̱hi hinda iza na pan cilabe. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Sa gyamui na gibo na ma pana; ama aza buco buika buna bu ginbo cilabe, hinda bube bui ia̱ shara'a na. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kamahinda na zwama, buna iri cikarigo a cimui, bu za kwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Kwa Hayahudawa na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Baniya ci daki bu za mupyala mu eewo! Ibrahim i kwaji haruni hinda acubago a Hwinsu, go abuna bu hyen buna bu yaje na cikarigo a cibo, bu za kwaji. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Bu zake buca a buci Ibrahim? Iba ma i kwaji ka̱mu na acubago a Hwinsu. Bai go bu zangi icwa nebo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu a cane, sa na cilabe icwa nimui, cilabe nimui i jidanuwa ihya. Buca̱ abumui, buna ga̱hi i hin an busa Hwinsu nuhin ube una zangacu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ko nga̱ uba sa i dakuwo Hwinsu, Gya na daki. Sa na hin na dakuwo na magalaga nga̱ ga̱hi, ama na daki hinda na iri cikarigo ci uba. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Buca a buhin Ibrahim i ia̱ wanwo na hon kurwo nimui; bu hyan hinda bu hoge laco. <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Hayahudawa ha hyen na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bui sa ia̱ haya kopeta&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hinda bu hyan Ibrahim!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kapi a mace Ibrahim, na yanse!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Nga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni, kwa aba na tangage hatare a bwage bware, ama Yesu ama swin, kwa na mahulo na curya suwa iginga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume buco buna aba mace burubo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu aba na ala,kwa aba na hyan buco buna aba mace burubo. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Kwa silmajiri na kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Walami, ganba bu ia̱ magwata̱, burubo buna ko mace buba, aba mace bo burubo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Sa buco buna ko mace buba a ia̱ magwata̱,&gt;&gt; ama a ia̱ ina zwama Hwinsu u cibe koce ibwana u ba pa buba <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Dole gya ia̱ ibwana i buna bo na cuma, kwa mohon musa gane. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Nga̱ gya na yiwa na doone, gyamui na sa cingero u doone.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />ga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni, kwa na cwana hatanbi na cinge, ihici cinge na hatanbi, kwa na sukutaga haisa buruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Kwa Yesu na hyen na burubo, &lt;&lt;Ala,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Masigitagi na iwaga Siluwam&gt;&gt; (ina aba yiwa na nupi cuman). Kwa buco na kore na maguzag, bo marenge yaba na hyanag. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Aco na mayabuta na buba hinda hyanagu bo na ia̱ una a kaba, &lt;&lt;Sa buco buna busa madale na ia̱ga una?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Acagiya aco hyen an bube.Aco mewa hyen, &lt;&lt;Aye, bu nyagana buba.&gt;&gt; Ama buba na icwa i buba bu natage, &lt;&lt;Gyamui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />A kaba, &lt;&lt;Neya haisa a habo hab ma gonje?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Buco buna aba ogo Yesu bube hici cinge kwa sukutaga na haisa. Bu hyen na gya kore na iwaga i Siluwam. Kwa gya na kore na ma guzaga, hinda kwa gya na hyanagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Kwa aba na kabana bwa, &lt;&lt;Bu yiwa honba?&gt;&gt; Bu hn, &lt;&lt;Na dakuwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kwa aba na kula buco buna busa buruba pa Haparisiyawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Baniya hon na Yesu aba hici cinge aba gonje haisa ha buco buna busa buruba u sanse hon ihupacu u hayahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Zwama haruni haparisiyawa ha kaba̱ bo nga̱ aba i buba hyanagi. Bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Bu tane cinge na haisa ha mui,&gt;&gt; hinda na guzagi, kwa gya na hyanagi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Haparisiyawa ha mewa ha hin, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bui san bu Hwinsu, zwama bu za na pan hon ihupacu u hayahudawa cilabe.&gt;&gt; Ama acage a kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Neya buco bu magwata̱ buba bwe ia̱ga i mamaki haruni?&gt;&gt; Hasoo haba ha habusage. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na jidana i kabana buco buna busa burubo, &lt;&lt;Bu hin buco buna bu guje hasa nibui daga mahuna ma arubo, bai go bui hin zwama buco buna?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Busa bucubago bu Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; bu cani. <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Hayahudawa hai taniwa soo an bu sanse buruba kwa nga̱ aba kaba̱ hacaca ha boba. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />A kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Busa bwa a buhin?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Buna ga̱hi i hin an busa buruba a buna? Neya baniya buba pwan i hyanagu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Hacaca ha cane, &lt;&lt;Ci daki busa bwa a buci,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hinda ci daki a mace bo buruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ama gaci baniya, ci dakuwo nga̱ buba hyanagi ko buna bu gonje bo haisa, ci dakuwo. Kaba̱ je bo. Bui sa bwa; bwe karigyaga na uno u buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Amace buba zwame haruni zwama iwasa i hayahudawa, zwama hayahudawa ha rigyano ha hin ana buna bu tani soo na Yesu a sa Kristi ai silacuma bo na suwa u iginga. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ube u san amace buba aba hin, &lt;&lt;Bui sa bwa ; kaba̱ bo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Kwa hayahudawa na gopa i uga aba mace buruba. A hya, &lt;&lt;Pan Hwinsu cilabe,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Gaci di ci daki buco buna busa buco bu magwata̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ko busa buco bu magwata̱ ko bu za, Na dakuwo. I bikan gya na daki. Na sase buruba ama baniya na hyanagi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />A gope i kaban bo, &lt;&lt;Baiya buba bu ia̱gi? Neya buba gonje haisa a habo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Bu cane ga,&lt;&lt;Na rigyano na zwamano hinda i yadwuwa.Bai ganhin i ginbo i hoge hinda? I gibo i san silmajiri sa Bware, hinda?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Kwa aba na cwana bo na hyen, &lt;&lt;Bu sa almajiri a buco buna! Gaci ci sa silmajiri si Musa! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Ci daki Hwinsu u ia̱ cikarigo na Musa, ama buco buna, ci dakuwo ihuga ina buba sirya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Kwa buruba na cane, &lt;&lt;Hoga i mamaki! I dakuwo ihuga ina buba sirya, ka̱mu na haruni bu gonje haisa a hamui. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ci daki Hwinsu u za kubla aco magwata̱. Ui kubla aco na za iwasa i Hwinsu ana ia̱gu ina uba hyen a ia̱. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tun na jigu u rwagu u doone ai sa tabuwa hoge buna bu gonje haisa ha buco aba mace buruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Sa buco buna bui sirya pa Hwinsu, bu za ia̱ga ihya. <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />A cane bo, &lt;&lt;Go buna aba bu mace na magwata̱; baiya go bu ginbo na ci cibaga!&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na silacuma bo na ijepu.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruba u anhuru a burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hoge an silacume bo na suwa u iginga, kwa aba na hyen, &lt;&lt;Bu tani soo na Bwa bu Buwama?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Buca̱ bu kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, ganba ne?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na zwama nga̱ gya na tani soo na buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu a hyen, &lt;&lt;Baniya bu hyano bo; kamahinda bube buyiwa na cikarigo na go.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Kwa buco na hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, na tani soo,&gt;&gt; kwa buba na pan bo cilabe. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Na es doone zwama gya ia̱ shara'a, Hinda aruba a hyanagya aco na hyanagi aruba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Inga haparisiyawa hana ha yanse ciyabu na Yesu hab hoge a zwame haruni na kabana, &lt;&lt;Baiya? Gaci ma ci sa aruba ka̱mu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu a hin naba, Sa ya sa aruba, ya za i zana uwonbe magwata̱; ama baniya nga̱ ga̱hi i hin an i hyanagi, uwonbe u magwata̱ a mahin ma yiwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Misali u buhuba bu hatamai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Kamahinda na zwama, buna bui ese wa na i'iba i byagu u hatamui, bu ka̱ri ese na i cagiye i'iba busa buhya na buco bu pashi <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Buco buna bu ese na i'iba i byagu bube bu sa buhubo bu hatamui. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Buco buna bu anpan i'iba bwe gonja i'eba, hinda hatamai hai kubla bicwarwa bi buba. Bui oga hatamui ha buba na iziya i haba hinda bu kule han na ijapu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Sa silacume ka̱mu hatamai ha buba, bu ali hatamui na lagan bo,zwama daki bicwarwa bi buhubo. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ama a za i lagana unyagata; kamahinda, ai yamana monda zwama ai dakuwo bicwarwa bi unyagata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu a ia̱gi aco cikarigo cini na misali, ama ai ganewa ina bware buba zwama ga. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Zwama haruni Yesu a jidane hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, gyamui na sa i'iba i hatamui. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Ka̱mu aco na a na zwalagi na kurwa a sa ahya na aco pashi, ama hatamui hai kubula ga. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Gyamui na sa i'iba; buna bo ese pa gya ai caga bo. Bui ese na suwa hinda bu sire bu hin icago, hinda bu ia̱ hubo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Buhya bu sa korya zwama bu ia̱ ihya hinda bu hone na hacigage; na kore zwama a hin a̱huru, a hin an a sinji. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa buhubo bu burya̠. Buhubo bu burya̠ busa bu pan a̱huru a buba zwama hatamui ha buba. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Buhubano buna aba one sa bube bu huzi hatamui. Sa bu hyan siwa hila na korwo, bu sa bu curi hatamai bu yamana monda. Iyinbu i konbe hatamui han ha mewa ha magatgage. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Buhubano buna aba one busa bu yamana monda zwama a one bo bu za madama ina i hyin hatamui. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Gyamui na sa buhubo bu burya̠ ; na daki hatamui a hamui hatamui a hamui ha na daki <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Nga̱ Buca̱ buba na daki harbuni hinda gya na daki bo hinda gya na pan a̱huru namui zwama hatamui a hamui. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Na za hatamui ha mewa han hai sa byagu uika na hana hatamui. Hab ma dole gya koleya ha. Hab ma hai na kubula bicwaro a bumui, hinda ai hyan garke uika na buhubo buika. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ina san Buca̱ abumui buba na ka̱ri zwama gya na pan a̱huru namui zwama gya gope i zangi an hinda. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Aza buna bui ca a̱huru nimui, ama zwama gya na pan icwa nimui. Na za koce gya na pan, hinda na za koce gya na ca. Ina Buca̱ abumui buba hin gya ni ia̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Zwama cikarigo cini ci Yesu aba zwame hayahudawa ha ese masinsa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Hayahudawa dinya ha hin, &lt;&lt;Mupyala mu eewo mu ese na bware ube san bware apisa. Bai san ga̱hi i kubli bware?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ama cagiya aco hin, &lt;&lt;Cikarigo cina ci sa ci buco bu mupyala mu eewo muba konbe. Buco bu mupyala mu eewo bui pwana i gunja haisa ha burubo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Na lokaci bazara, aba na lago ui i cutan iginga pa Hwinsu na Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />hinda Yesu aba na suwa ui iginga nai jabaga na uzak Sulemanu. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Kwa Hayahudawa na ringan bware, na hin, &lt;&lt;Hal binba goo bui san ci hina nagu ui tana soo? Sa gabui busa Kristi, ci zwama ta ci songa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Na zwama, ama i taniwa soo. I mamaki gya na ia̱gu na ize i Buca̱ a bumui i cibe ko ganba gya na sa, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />ama i taniwa soo zwama ga̱hi i sa hatamui a hamui. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Hatamui a hamui ha sa ha kubula bicwarwa a bi mui; na daki ha, hinda ha na daki. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Na pan ga a̱huru ana aza ihogu, hinda aza i kwaji; a za buna bui na caga na wa numui. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Buca̱ abumui, buna bu na pan ga, bu zake tiganba; a za buna bwe ca ga na wa u buca a buci. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Gya na Buca̱ abumui cisa i bikan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Hinda hayahudawa ha zangi hatare ha ginbo i ibwaga Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />ama Yesu a hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Ne cibai ga i mamaki dinyiya ina i sirya pa Buca̱ abumui. unba uikan ga̱hi i ginbo na bwaga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Hayahudawa ha cane, &lt;&lt;Ci karuwo na bu ibwaga na hatare zwama ini ka̱mu go bu zwame,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ama zwama goo bu cwane Hwinsu, zwama goo, buco, bu maise icwa nibui busa Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ai rubuci na icibago i Musa, &lt;&lt;Na hin ga̱hi i sa ha Hwinsu&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ci daki cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci za ia̱ cibya hinda Hwinsu u uga aco ni &lt;ha Hwinsu&gt; Aco na hoge cicuma ci uba. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />gya buna Buca̱ uba na tanga hinda u ba na cuman na doone? Bai san ga̱hi i hin an na cwane Hwinsu zwama gya na hin, &lt;Nasa Bwa bu Hwinsu&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Sa ibwana i Buca̱ abumui gya na yiwa na ia̱ga i ta tani soo na gya. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ama sa ibe gya na yiwa na ia̱ga, ko i taniwa soo na gya, tani soo na ibwana, nga̱ ga̱hi i daki na Buca̱ bu yiwa na soo numui, gya hinda na soo u Buca̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Hinda a ka̱ri i gopa i konbe Yesu, ama bu ma huri ikonbo yaba. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kwa Yesu na maringya ukacaso uwo u Yodan ihuga ina i Yohana aba ia̱ baptisma a jigu. Bu ma dale a payi <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />hinda aco dinya a kore pa Bware. A hin, &lt;&lt;Yohana a sa tabuwa ia̱ga i mamaki, i ka̱mu ina Yohana aba zwame game na buco buna isa kamahinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na payi aco dinya a tani soo na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">U'o u li'azaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Aza buco buna aba ogo Li'azaru buna bu yanse na mahona. Bware busa buco bu Betani, Betani usa i'ogo i Imaryamu na buhun bu Imarta buba madale. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Imaryamu ina, isa buhun bu Li'azaru ana ai huguwa laco, ibe i sukutage Buca̱ bu yaba turare hinda i susuryage buna bware na cihinji ci icwa iba. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ahun ani cu'a barya̱ Imarta na Imaryamu a cuma pa Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, a'osa na goo bu kala̱ bui hogo laco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hoge haruni, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Mahona mana maza kula bware pa u'o. Aye, ama ui san cilabe ci bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu a ka̱ri Imarta na Imaryamu na buhun bwa ba Li'azaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hoge li'azaru ai hogo laco, kwa bware na yisana ihuga ina bware yiwa hal mohon murya. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kwa bware na hyen na silmajiri si bware, &lt;&lt;Ci maringe je kurwa u Yahudiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Silmajiri si Yesu si hin, &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; Mohon a muna mu ali Hayahudawa ha ka̱ri na bu taga na hatare, hinda go bu ka̱ri na maringya hwayi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Sa awa ikope na arya na ihurumu? Ka̱mu buna yiwa na ia̱ cihano na hwinsu bi za majubuta, zwama bu hyanagi malanga ma doone pa ihuga ina buba yiwa na jabaga. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ama buna bu yiwa na cihano na gita bui majubuta, zwama bu yiwa cihano na ci'icu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi zwamaga, a jidane hyen ba, &lt;&lt;A'osa naci li'azaru a yiwa na malabo;ama na ginbo i kore hwayi zime bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Silmajiri si bware si cane, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, sa malabo ma zangi bware, bui rumgya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu a yiwa na nupi Liazaru a koji, ama silmajiri sa nga̱ na malabo ma ihupacu. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Kwa Yesu na zwaman ga an a yiwa na nupi, &lt;&lt;Li'azaru a koji, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />hinda zwama ga̱hi na yiwa na wawo na yanuwa payi, nga̱ ganhin i tani soo. Ama ci kore pa bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Kwa Toma (ana aba ogo Agilo) a hyen na silmajiri sa cagiye, &lt;&lt;Gaci ma ci ali, ci koji tare na bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asa asengewa aco na kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Nga̱ Yesu aba wuci, bware bu hoge an Li'azaru a iu mohon mu nasi na suwa izi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betani a yabuta na Urshalima ai yucuwo mili arya, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />hayahudawa dinya ha kore zwama ha bonge Imarta na Imaryamu zwama u'o u buhun bwa ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Nga̱ Imarta iba hoge na Yesu a yiwa na korwa, kwa iba na kore igico bware, ama Imaryamu yinsa na yaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Imarta i hyen na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Si bwa yiwa pini, buhunwo bumui bwa za koji. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ama ko baniya Hwinsu u bu pan ina go bu one.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu a hyen ne ba, &lt;&lt;Buhunwo a bob boi masenga hinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Imarta i cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Na daki bui masenga hon ikundagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu a hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa wasengewo na a̱huru. Buna bu tani soo na gya bu za kwaji, ko bu kwaji; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />hinda buna bu yiwa na bu tani soo na gya bu za kwaji. Bu yaje na haruni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni, Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; i zwama Yesu, &lt;&lt;Na tani soo na go busa Kristi, bwa bu Hwinsu, buna bu yiwa na korwa na doone.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Hinda nga̱ iba zwame haruni, kwa iba na maringya i oga buhun bu cu'a bui ba Imaryamu na suwa. &lt;&lt;Walami u kurwa,&gt;&gt; i hin, &lt;&lt;Hinda bu yiwa na bu ginbaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nga̱ Imaryamu iba hoge haruni, kwa iba na masenga kore pa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu a sa esuwa hilo kacumo, bu yanse ihuga ina i Imarta iba bangi Bware. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Hayahudawa hana ha yiwa tare na Imaryamu na suwa u yaba, na ia̱gi yan ubungago u'o, ha hyan i masenge na mabuna i sere, kwa haba na lagana yan, ha nga̱ an i ka̱ri kore pa izi i ia̱ cidaro apayi. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />a̱ga Imaryamu iba wuci ihuga ina Yesu aba yiwa hinda i hyan bware, kwa iba na kuztan na hyen, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, sa bwa yiwa pini, buhunwo a bu mui bo za ikwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hyan yan na cidaro tare na aco hayahudawa han ha laga yan na cidaro, kwa yama na konbe bware dinya na soo u buba. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu kwa na kaban, &lt;&lt;Hunba ganhin i labte bware.?&gt;&gt; I cane, &lt;&lt;Kurya hyan, Buca̱ bu yaba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu a dare. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Kwa hayahudawa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Byana nga̱ bware buba ka̱ri bo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ama hacagiya ha ma zwama na soo u haba, &lt;&lt;Bware bu gonje haisa ha buruba, bai san buba bui gazgan buco buna ikwaji?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Nga̱ Yesu, aba gope hoge yama na soo dinya, a kore pa izi. Izi ini isa ubanda na tare aba gunda i'eba iba. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu a hyen na Imarta, buhun bu buca na bwa kwaji &lt;&lt;Zangaca tare.&gt;&gt; Imarta i cane, &lt;&lt;Ama, Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Baniya bware bu pwaso hinda bui yana na uwunsu zwama bware bu za mohon mu nasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Na zwamanuwa an sa bu tani soo bui hyan izangacu i Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kwa aba na zaciga tare.Yesu a byane zata kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱, na gojo nga̱ go bu na hoge. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Na daki si na hoge, ama na zwame haruni zwama aco na yiwa yinsiga pini, zwama a tani soo ana gabui buna cuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Nga̱ Bware buba zwame haruni, Yesu a uga na koce, &lt;&lt;Li'azaru, sirya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Kwa buco buna bu kwaji na sirya, si wa na buna palage na ulapo u cene, i sinu i palage na ulapo una aba wuba bware. Yesu a hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Zaciga hazunga han wuba bware na haba hinda bo ali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ka̱ri i hone Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Zwama haruni hayahudawa hana ha kore zwama bonge Imaryamu, hinda ha hyan ina Yesu aba ia̱gi, ha tani soo na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ama hayahudawa ha mewa ha kore pa haparisiyawa kwa na zwaman ga ina Yesu aba ia̱. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kwa bulabe bulabe na Haparisiyawa na ugan a i dala a aco labe. A kaba, &lt;&lt;Baiya gaci yiwa na ia̱ga?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Buco buna abuna na ia̱ga i mamaki dinya. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Si ci curi bo na ia̱ga ina haruni, tiganba bui tani soo na buba, hinda Haromawa hai kore ha ci cage ihuga na cinge a cici.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Kwa buco buikan, buna aba ogo Kayapa, buna busa bulabe bulabe ni uya uni, na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi i dakuwo ihya ko comu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />I dakuwo u zake buco bwekan bu kwaji si sa aco cinge ka̱mu a kwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Cikarigo cina ci Kayapa aba ia̱ sa zwama icwa ya ba, ama zwama buba sanse bulabe bulabe na uya uni bu zwame ina i pale an Yesu ai kwaji zwama cinge ci Hayahudawa, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />sa zwama cinge ci hayahudawa ka̱mu ama zwama saawo sa Hwinsu sina si gatagage, a san ikanga bikan. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Tun na hon ni aba na ginbo yina aba ai hone Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Zwama haruni Yesu a jidanuwa ma hyaga pa hayahudawa. Ama Yesu a curi payi kwa na kore usala una u yabuta na hilo, korwa hilo na aba ogo Iprayim, ihuga ina bware buba yisa na silmajiri sa bware. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Nga̱ lago ui i kacikago u hayahudawa uba wa kore, aco dinya na a sirya hilo kurwo u Urshalima zwama a ma guzagi ciri sa ba nga̱ aba sabe kapi lago ui kacigago. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />A hina ginbo u Yesu, kwa a yisan na suwa ui iginga kwa aba na ma kaban, &lt;&lt;Bai ga̱hi i hyan? Bware bwe korya pa lago uni nabiya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Zwama alabe labe na Haparisiyawa ha rigyano ha zwam an buna bu ha̱n Yesu, bu zwama ga nga̱ aba ai kore a konbe bware.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">A sukutage Yesu manobe na Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Lago ui kacigago u gane mohon u cunuhin, Yesu a wuci Betani, ihuga ina Li'azaru aba yiwa, ana Yesu aba wasingoo pa aco a kwajo. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Apayi aba egyi Yesu mare ma uyibe. Imarta ibe i habusage mare, Li'azaru a yanse tare na aco na re mare tare na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kwa Imaryamu na zangi itako i turare ma kamshi ma musare dinya mana aba ia̱ na nard; kwa na sukutage turare e na buna u Yesu kwa na susuryaga na cihinji ci icwa i ba. Kwa kamshi na sinji yaba ka̱mu. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ama almajiri aikan, ana aba ogo Yahuda Iskariyoti, buna cutan Yesu, bu hin, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Bai san aba za i sanga turare ma kamshi a pan aco na za ihya? sa sange muso u musare u wuci ina aba cupago buco bui ibwana uya uika. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yahuda ai zwamu haruni zwama a ka̱ri aco na za ihya ama zwama bo sa buhya; bware bube busa kumgage ipamo i musare mu ba, busa dangi ci'iru cini. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Curya yan.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Da ma i iri turare ma kamshi zwa hon iwunbanu nimui. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Tuhonba i za aco za ihya tare na ga̱hi, ama iza tare na gya tuhonba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Nga̱ Hayahudawa han ha matanaga hab hoge an Yesu a yiwa payi hinda a kore, sa zwama Yesu hab ha kore ama zwama ha hyan Li'azaru, ana Yesu aba wasingoo pa aco a kwajo. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kwa alabe labe na ia̱ shiri nga̱ aba ai konbe Li'azaru a hone ma, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />zwama Li'azaru hayahudawa dinya ha kore pa Yesu na tana soo na Bware.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a ese Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Nga̱ ubugwa uba bonge aco na matanaga na a kore zwama lago ui i kacikago a hoge na Yesu a yiwa na yina u kurwo u urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />A gundagi habwabwa ha u'on kwakwa a sire zwama a bangi bware, na i danda bicwaro, &lt;&lt;Hosana!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;I burya̠ i sa buna bu yiwa na koro na iziya Buca̱ bu yaba!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;I burya̠ i sa pa Bugwama bu Isra'ila!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu a hyin aziyaki a noya kwa na yindana zata a ba, kyabo Nga̱ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwame, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;I ta huga iwasa saawo si cu'a si Sihiyona; byana, bugwama a buhin bu yiwa na kurwo,bu madale zata u aziyaki a noya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Na jigu silmajiri sa Yesu sa ganewa ini ka̱mu. Kwa nga̱ Yesu aba masingiye na cilabe pa aco kwajo kacumo siba gane ana a i ini ka̱mu zwama Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Baniya aco upugu ana yanse na bware lokaci una u bware uga Li'azaru na suwa u izi na wasingoo i bware pa aco a kwajo a ina ia̱gya aco cikarigo ci laco. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Aco dinyiya, nga̱ aba huge bware bu iyi i mamaki, a sire zwama a bangi bware. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kwa haparisiyawa na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Byana, ina za ni ci kula pa ihya. Byan nga̱ doone ka̱mu uba yiwa na kure pa bware!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nga̱ aba ai kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Baniya Hahelenawa haba ma ha yanse na aco na kure Urshalima zwama ha pa Hwinsu cilabe hun lago ui i kacikago. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Kwa aba na kore pa Filibus, ana a sa buco bu Betsaida u sala u Galili, na ginbo ihya Yesu. Kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ci ginbo i hyan Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filibus a kore kwa aba na zwamana Andarawus; kwa aba aco barya na kore na zwamana Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu kwa na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Lokaci u ia̱ una Bwa bu Buwama aba ai pa bo cilabe. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kamahinda na zwama, sa bibero bi alkama ai wunbanu na cinge bi kwaji, bi yana biba. Ama sa bi kwaji, bi pana imata i saawo dinya. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ka̱mu buna bu ginbo a̱huru a buba bui nagi an, hinda buco buna bui ka̱ruwo icwa i buba na doone una bui hyan a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ka̱mu buna bui ni ia̱gya ibwana dole buna laga; zwama bugyama abumui bui yana na gya ihuga ina gya. Buca̱ abumui bui pan cilabe pa buco buna bu na laga. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Baniya soo nimui hacigage, baiya gya na hin? &lt;Buca̱, na cagage baniya&gt;? Aye, ina san gya na kore bini na lokaci una. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Buca̱, pan iziya nibo cilabe!&gt;&gt; Kwa na hoge cikarigo na zaro, &lt;&lt;Ai n pan an cilabe, hinda na jidana i pan an cilabe hinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Aco na matanaga nga̱ aba hoge cikarigo an hin bita bi serya; acagiya aco hin acuma abe a karigyane bware. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu an hin, bicwarwa bini bi sa zwama ga̱hi, sa gya mui. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Baniya hun u iu aba ai ia̱gya aco doone shara'a; baniya aba ai ance bwa bu bugwama bu doone. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ama sa na, zangaci zata na cinge, na kaje aco ka̱mu kurwa a pamui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Bu zwame haruni zwama bu cibe iri u'o una bware buba bwe ia̱.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Kwa aco na hyen na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ci hoge na icibago i Musa na Kristi a za kwaji, naiya go bui hin, &lt;Ai zangaca Bwa bu Buwama&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu a zwama ga, &lt;&lt;I hyan cingero na lokaci cimu. Eaga cihano kwa cingero u siyiwa, kapi ci'incu ci bu bangi. Buco buna bu yiwa na cihano na ci'icu bui dakuwo ihuga ina buba yiwa ala. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Tana soo nuboi na cingero, lokaci una go buza on, nga̱ ga̱hi i san saawo sa cingero.&gt;&gt; Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi zwamaga, Yesu a curi payi kwa na maswan pa ba.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hayahudawa ha wonje Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ko nga̱ Yesu a ia̱gi i mamaki dinya na haisa ba, ka̱mu na haruni ai taniwa soo na bware. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />A ia̱ ini zwama a sinji ina Acubago a Hwinsu Ishaya aba hin: &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, ganba bu tani soo na cicuma a cici, a cubaga ganba ina wa u Buca̱ bu yaba uba ia̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ube u san ai taniwa soo, zwama, nga̱ Ishaya iba zwamage na ihuga i mewa: <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;Haisa haba ha ruba hinda soo ha ba ha danri, nga̱ aba za i hyan ko ha gane na hasoo haba, ko ha ma ringiya a pamui gya hungacume ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya acuma i zwame haruni zwama i hyan izangacu i Yesu hinda bu ia̱ cikarigo ci bware.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ka̱mu na haruni aco dinya ka̱mu na buco bu labe bu majalisa a tani soo na bware. Ama zwama Haparisiyawa a wonje ciba i tani soo yaba zwama iwasa aba ai silacuma ga na suwa ui iginga; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />zwama a zake i ka̱ri cilabe ya aco na ina Hwinsu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikarigo ci Yesu ci ia̱ shara'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Kwa Yesu ia̱ cikarigo na koce na hin, &lt;&lt;Sa Buca̱ bu yaje na gya, sa gyamui kawai buba tani soo, ama bu yaje na buna bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Sa buna byane, bui hyan buna bwa na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Na kore doone nga̱ cingero, ka̱mu buna bu tani soo na gya buta madala na ci'incu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ka̱mu buna bu hoge icibago nimui hinda bui kumgaguwa ca, na za ia̱gya bo shara'a. Na korya doone zwama gya doone shara'a, ama zwama gya cagage ga. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Aco na a na wonje na aco na a wonje i ca cikarigo a cimu alkali a yiwa an ai ia̱gya ga shara'a; cikarigo cina ci gya ia̱ cibe ci san a konbe hon kundata. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ina gya na yiwa na cibaga sa koce nimui, ama Buca̱ abumui buna bo na cuma bube bu ni cibe ina gya ni zwame. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na daki a̱huru ana aza ihogu ai hyan an pa ihuga ina Buca̱ buba sa bu pan. Zwama haruni ina gya na zwame isa ina Buca̱ abumui buba hin gya zwame.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a guzagi buna u silmajiri sa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Wa sanuwo kapi lago ui kacigago. Yesu a daki na lokaci waba u i aba ai cura̱ doone a maringe pa Buca̱. Bu cibe an sa buba maka̱la̱ an yiwa na doonee, bu cibe ga maka̱la̱ hal kurwo ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na silmajiri si bware aba na re mare ma uyenbe, bugwama bu eewo bu rigyano bo eso na soo Yahuda Iskariyoti, bwa bu Saminu, na bu cuta a hone Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu a daki ka̱mu tibai na Buca̱ bu iri ka̱mu koce tibai na wa u Bware, hinda bo sire pa a Hwinsu hinda bwe marigya pa Hwinsu; <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />kwa Yesu na masenga pa ihuga ina aba yiwa na re mare kwa na mabwajiga cilapo ci ijapu kwa na mapala itawul na abe. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Hinda kwa halan miya na udase kwa na rwaga iguzaga buna u Silmajiri, buba na isusuryaga na itawul ina buba mapala na abe a buba.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Nga̱ Yesu aba a korya pa Saminu buna aba ogo Bitrus, ana a hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, gabui bui na guzaga buna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Baniya bui dakuwo ina gya nayiwa na ia̱ga, ama bwe kore daki sa lokaci u i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Bitrus a hin, &lt;&lt;Aye,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na za iyaje go na guzagi buna.&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Sa ne bu guzaguwo buna, buza habe na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Saminu buna aba ogo Bitrus a cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; sa buna ama siwa na icwa ka̱mu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu a hyen, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu masigi bui ma guzagu buna kawai; zwama ikanga i buba i za ciriyo. Hinda go bu za ciriyo, ko nga̱ uba sa, ka̱mu nuhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Zwama Yesu a daki buna bu ginbo i cutan bware, ube u san buba hyen sa ka̱mu nuhin i za ciri.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi i guzaga buna u silmajiri, kwa bware na gupa na mabwadana cilapo kwa na maringya ihuga ina buba bo yiwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />&lt;&lt;I yiwa na oga &lt;Walami&gt; na &lt;Buca̱ bu yaba&gt; harbuni uba yiwa, zwama ina gya na sa bini. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Bane gya, Buca̱ bu yaba na Walami, ni guzagi buna nuhin, ga̱hi ma ala je i guzagi buna i sicwa a sihin. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ne cibe misali zwama ga̱hi hinda i ia̱ nga̱ gya na ia̱gi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kamahinda na zwama, aza bugyama buna bu zake Buca̱ bu yaba bu buba, ko hinda bucuma bu zake buna bwa cuma bo. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Baniya nga̱ ga̱hai i daki ini, i hyan unu burya̠ si ia̱gi ini.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zwame buna bui cutan bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Na za na ia̱ cikarigo a cihin ka̱mu; na daki aco na gya na tanga. Ama uni usa zwama a sinji ina aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu: &lt;Buna bu yiwa na re mare tare na buba bu ka̱ri na hona.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />&lt;&lt;Na yiwa na i zwamgana kapi ini i ia̱gi, nga̱ sa i ia̱gi i tani soo na gya Na sa Gyamui. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kamahinda na zwama, buna bu ce buna bu gya na cuma bu na ce gyamui; hinda buna bu na ce bu ce buna bo na cuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Nga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni, i dame Yesu suwa dinya hal bu hin, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, buco bweka ciki nuhin bui na cutan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Silmajiri si ma byane, zwama si daki ko ganba buba Bware yiwa na nupi. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Almajiri a bware buika, buna Yesu aba ka̱ri bu madale ciyabu na bware. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus a ia̱ buna bu madale ciyabu na Yesu wa, &lt;&lt;Kaban Bware ko ganba buba hin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Almajiri ani a danjigane kwa na kaban Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, ganba ne?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Buna gya na pan bo ikinda i burodi una hinda pan bo bu be.&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na zangi ikinda i burudi, na pan Yahuda Iskariyoti, bwa bu Saminu. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Nga̱ Yahuda aba ce ikinda i burodi, Bugwama bu eewo kwa na ese suwa u bware. Yesu a hyen na bware, &lt;&lt;Ina go bu ginbo ia̱, ia̱ na mabuna,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ama aza buna bo gane ina san Yesu aba hyen haruni na Yahuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Nga̱ uba sa Yahuda ube i kumgage ipamo i musare, acagiya a nga̱ Yesu a ia̱gi bware cikarigo i sango ina aba ginbo a sanya zwama lago ui kaceewo, ko hinda a pan aco na za ihya. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Nga̱ Yahuda aba ce burodi, kwa aba na sere na ijapu. Hinda u sanse gita.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikarigo ci pu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Nga̱ Yahuda aba sere, Yesu kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Baniya aba cilabe Bwa bu Buwama hinda Hwinsu u hin cilabe pa buba. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Sa a zangacu Hwinsu pa bwa, Hwinsu ui zangacu bwa zwam icwa u ba, hinda ui zangaca bwa na cikan.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />&lt;&lt;Sawo a simui, naza i sana na ga̱hi. I na ginbaga, nga̱ gya na zwama Hayahudawa, harbuni gya na zwama baniya: I huga ina gya nayiwa na ala, iza i pwana korwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Hinda baniya na pan cikarigo ci pun: ka̱la̱ngi sicwa asihin. Nga̱ gya ni ka̱langi, zwama haruni usa dole ga̱hi ima ka̱nlangi sicwa asihin. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Na harbuni aco ba ai daki an i sa silmajiri a simui, si i maka̱la̱ngi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a zwame na Bitrus ai masinsa daku i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oeg Bitrus kwa na kaban Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, hunba go bu ginbo i kore?&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ihuga ina gya na ginbo kore, buza i pwana na lagana baniya, ama sa i majidane bui na laga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Bitrus a kaba̱ Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, bai i san gya naza i pwan bu lagana baniya? Na yaje gya kwaji zwama go.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda bui kwaji zwama gya? Kamahinda nabu zwama, kapi uka̱ri u uga, bui hin an bui na dakuwo hal korwo utaco<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu abe asa yina u korwo pa Buca̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu a hyen &lt;&lt;Ita yada hasuwa hahin ha hacigage. Yada na Hwinsu hinda i tani soo na gya. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Na yaba Buca̱ bumui aza hakaba dinya; sa harbuni, Na za na i zwamana. Na ka̱ri ala zwama gya i kimgage ihuga. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Sa na alu na kimgago ihuga, Na maringe hinda gya i zangi zwama i yan na gya nga̱ ga̱hi i yana ihuga ina gya na yiwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />I daki yina ana a ali ihuga ina i gya na yiwa na ala.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Kwa Toma na hyen na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba ci dakuwo ihuga ina goo bu ginbo i kore, neya gaci ci daki yina a koro pa yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Kwa Yesu na cane bware, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na sa yina na kamahinda na a̱huru. Az buna bui kore pa Buca̱ kwa a pamui <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Sa ya na daki gya, ya daki Buca̱ a bumui hinda. korwo baniya, bui daki bo hinda i hyan bo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filibus a cane, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, ci cibe Buca̱ hinda uni u ci jube.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;I na dakuwo gya, Filibus, ko ma inga gya na sano na ga̱hi? Ka̱mu buna bo na hyano bu hyano Buca̱ a bumui. Neya goo bui hin, &lt;Ci cibe Buca̱&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />I taniwa soo an na yiwa na suwa u Buca̱, hinda Buca bu yiwa na gya? Cikarigo cina ci gya na ia̱ ci sa a cimu. Kwa di, Buca, buna bu buyiwa na suwa nimui, buna bu yiwa na ia̱ga ibwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Tana je suwa na gya sa na hyen na ga̱hi na yiwa na Buca̱ hinda Buca̱ bu yiwa na gya; ko hinda i tani soo i mamaki na gya na yiwa na ia̱ga. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kamahinda na zwama, ka̱mu buna bu tane soo na gya bwe ia̱ga ina gya na yiwa na ia̱ga. Bui ia̱ga ina zake ina gya na, zwama na yiwa na ala pa Buca̱. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Hinda na bu ia̱gi ka̱mu ina ga̱hi i kaba na izi nimu, nga̱ Bwa buba bui kulage Buca̱ cilabe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Sa ina kaba tibai na izi nimui, nabu ia̱gya ini.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alkawali a a̱huru Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Sa ina ka̱ri i ia̱ga ina gya na hin an i ia̱gi. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Hinda na kaba̱ Hwinsu Buca̱, hinda bui pan bubanganu, buna bui yan na ga̱hi na dala ana za ihogu <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Buca̱ banganu buni, bube a san a̱huru a Hwinsu a kamahinda ai ciba kamahinda na Hwinsu. Doone uza ica bo, zwama u za i hyan bo ko u daki bo. Ama ga̱hi i daki bo, zwama bu madale na ga̱hi hinda ui yana na suwa na ga̱hi. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Sa na ali na za na icurya ganhi na maringe a pahin. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Na i cimu, doone u za na hyana, hinda i na hyana, zwama gya na zi a̱huru ana za ihogu ga̱hi ma i yan na a̱huru mana za ihogu. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Sa hon uni u kore i daki na yiwa na Buca̱ a bumui, hinda i yiwa na gya ga̱hi hinda i yiwa na gya. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Buna bu na laga cikarigo a cimu, bu be busa buna bu na ka̱ri.Buna bu na ka̱ri bui ka̱ri Buca̱ a bumui, gya hinda na ka̱ri bo hinda na ciba icwa nimui pa buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Kwa Yahuda (Sa Yahuda Iskariyoti) na hin, &lt;&lt;Ama, Buca̱ bu yaba, neya go bu ginbo na ma ciba icwa nebo pa gaci hinda sa na doone?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu a cane, Ka̱mu buna ka̱ri, bwe lagana icibago nimui. Buca̱ a bumui bui ka̱ri bo, hinda Buca̱ a bumui na gya ci kore ci madale na buba. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Buna bui na ka̱ri wo bu za i lagana icibago nimui. Hinda icibago ina i ga̱hi i hoge gya, i sa nimui; Ama i sere pa Buca̱ a bumui buna bwa na cuma.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Na zwama ini ka̱mu kwa na yiwa tare na ga̱hi. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ama bubanganu, a̱huru a Hwinsu, ana Buca̱ buba bui cuma na ize nimui, bui cibaga i ka̱mu hinda bui butaryaga tibai ka̱mu ina gya na zwame. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Dala a burya̠ gya na curigagi; dala a burya̠ namui a gya na pan. Ana gya na pan ai nyaganuwa na ana a doone uba pangano. Ita yana hasoo ahahi ha hacigage hinda ita huga iwasa.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />I hoge na hin, &lt;Na ginbo i ala hinda na yiwa na maringe a pahin.&gt; SI na ka̱ri, i hoge laco gya na hyen na ginbo i kore pa Buca̱ abumui, zwama Buca̱ bu na zake gya. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Baniya na zwama kapi i ia̱gi, zwama sa i korya i ia̱gi i tani soo na ina gya na zwama. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Na za i sana na cikarigo na ga̱hi, zwama bugwama bu doone una bu yiwa na korwa. Ama buza koce na gya, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ama doone ui daki na ka̱ri Buca̱ hinda na ia̱gu ina Buca̱ a bumui buba hin gya ia̱.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Kurya je, ci mu curi pini.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a asa u'on u inabi u kamahinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesu a hyen, gyamui nasa ipicu i kamahinda i u'on u inabi, hinda Buca̱ a bumui busa Buco bu enta. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Hwinsu ui gunji ka̱mu ubwabwa nimui una ui uza imata, hinda ubwabwab una u i imata si bu kimga zwama u jidane ia̱ imata. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ko baniya ma ai guzagu zwama cikarigo cina ci gya na ia̱gi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Yan je na gya, hinda gya yan na ga̱hi. Aza ubwabwa una ui ia̱ imata na icwa i ba; dole u yan na ipicu. Harbuni buza pwana i ia̱ imata kwa bu magami na gya.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Gyamui na sa ipicu u'on u Inabi ga̱hi i sa habwabwa.Buna bu yiwa na gya na buba, bui ia̱ imata dinya; buza i pwan ia̱ga ihya sa buza tare na gya. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Buna bu buza na gya, bu nyaga na ubwabwa una aba kwama u hoye; iri hani habwabwa sa tangage a tanaga, a cubi ula. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Sa yiwa na gya hinda cikarigo a cimui ci yiwa na go, kaban ka̱mu ina go bu ginbo, hinda bui hya gya. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Cilabe ci Buca̱ a bumui, i cibe si yiwa na pan imata dinya, na haruni i san silmajiri asimui.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nga̠ Buca̱ abumui buba na ka̱ri, harbuni gya na ka̱ri. Baniya yinsana je na maka̠la̱ amamui. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Sa i laga cikarigo acimui, i yisan pa maka̠la̠ amamui, nga̱ gya na lagano cikarigo ci Buca̱ abumui hinda na yisa pa maka̠la̠ ma buba. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Na zwama haruni nga̱ wa̱wo nimui uba ui yana na ga̠hin hinda wanwo nuhin u sinji. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Cikarigo a cimui a cina: Ka̠la je sicwa a sihin nga̱ gya na i ka̱ri. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Aza maka̠la̠ mana ma zake maniyo, Buca̱ bu kwaji zwama maka̠la̠ ma si'osa a buba. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Hinda isa si'osa a simui si i cikarigo a cimui. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Na za na ugakana gyama, zwama bugyama bui dakuwo ina buca buyaba buba yiwa na ia̱ga. Ama na uga si'osa zwama na zwama ina ka̠mu gya na hoge pa Buca̱ a bumui. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Sa ga̠hia̱ ina tanga, ama gyamui na tanga hinda na san i kure i mace saawo-saawo nga̱ u'on sina si sana una uza i hogu.Hinda Buca̱ a bumui bui pan ka̱mu ina ga̱hi i kaba̱ bo na iziya nimui. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ina, gya na zwama bina: i maka̱la̱ naji sicwa a sihin.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doone u wonje silmajiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Yesu a zwama silmajiri sa ba, &lt;&lt;Sa doone ui wonje, dak je an u na wonje na jigu. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Si yasa bu doone, doone ui bu kala̱ nga̱ buco buba. Inga uba sa, i sa bu doone, ama na tanga ga̱hi na suwa u doone. Ube u san aco doone aba ui wonje. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mabutaryagya je ina gya na zwama: &lt;Aza bugyama buna bu zake Buca̱ bu yaba bu buba.&gt; Sa aco na pan wahala, ai pan wahala hinda. Sa laga cikarigo cimui ai lagana acihin hinda. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ama ai ia̱gya ka̱mu ini zwama ga̱hi isa abumui, zwama ai dakuwo buna bo na cuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Sa na ia̱gu ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu, aza i san aco magwata̱. Ama baniya aza i hyan ihuga i sirwa zwama magwata̱ ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />ka̱mu buna bu na wonje bu wonje Buca̱ abumui. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Aza i san aco magwata̱ sa na ia̱gu ga ibwana ina aza buna bwa tabo i ia̱ga, a hyan ina gya na ia̱ kwa aba na wonda na Buca̱ abumui. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ini a ia̱ zwama a sinji cikarigo cina aba rubuci na icibago ci ba:An wonje na ia̱gu ga ko ihya.<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Yesu a hin &lt;&lt;Ni san buna bui banganu bui kore a pahin-a̱huru a Hwinsu ai cibaga cikarigo ci kamahinda ci Hwibsu na buna bwa sere pa Buca̱, bui ia̱ cikarigo a cimui. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ga̱hi hinda i ia̱ cikarigo zwama gya, zwama i yiwa na gya tun na jigu.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu a hyen, &lt;&lt;Ne zwama ini ka̱mu zwama go ta curya itano i suwa nuhin. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ai silacuma na ihuga i tanaganu i hayahudawa; hun yiwa na korwo una aco na ai hone a nga̱ na a yiwa na zangacu Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Aco ai ia̱gya haruni zwama a dakuwo Buca̱ abumui. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Na zwama ini ka̱mu, zwam i daki sa hin ini i yiwa na ia̱ga, i mabutaryage na cikarigo cini ka̱mu.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibwana a̱huru a Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ama baniya na ginbo na maringya pa buna bwa na cuma, ka̱mu na haruni, aza buna bu na kaba̱, &lt;Hunba go bu ginbo i kore?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ama baniya nga̱ gya na zwama kaba̱, hasoo ahahi hacigage. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ama na yiwa na zwamgana kamahinda: u kamaci pa gahi gya a̱li, si ni ta a̱liwo, bu banganu bu za i korya̱ ahwahi; ama si na ali, na cuma bo ahwahi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Hinda si bu banganu bu kore, bui kunbe aco doone na magwata̱ ma aco na zi ciri na iri na si burya̠ hinda na shara'a Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />magwata̱ ma doone, zwama ai taniwa soo na gya; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />a gwaci pa ina isa burya̠, zwama na ginbo i kore pa Buca̱ a bumui, ihuga ina ga̱hi i za na hyanakana; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />hinda a gwaci pa cikarigo ci shara'a, zwama bugwama bu doone una a ia̱gu bo shara'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Na za i mewa dinya ina gya na bu zwamana, ama iza i pwana i zangi ga baniya. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ama hon una, a̱huru a Hwinsu a kamahinda, sa kore. ai bu ciba yina a kamahinda. Buza ia̱ cikarigo na koce u icwa i buba, bui ia̱ cikarigo ci ina buba hoge hinda bui zwamana ina yiwa na korwo. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Bui na pan cilabe zwama bwe zangi ina gya na zwamage hinda bui zwama ga̱hi. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Ina Buca̱ abumui buba za isa nimui. Ube u san gya na hin, a̱huru a burya̠ ai zangi ina isa nimui hinda u na zwama.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">I hacigago i soo i maringe wanwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Na lokaci cimu ina hyana hinda na lokaci cimu iza na hyanakana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Silmajiri si makaba, &lt;&lt;bai Bware buba yiwa na nupi Buba hin na gaci, &lt;Na lokaci cimu iza na hyan, sa i majidane cimu hinda i na hyana, kwa bware na hin hinda, &lt;Zwama na ginbo i kore pa Buca̱&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />A re gaba makabo &lt;&lt;Baiya, Ini iba sa, buba hin &lt;I cimu&gt;? Ci dakuwo ina bware buba yiwa na zwamaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu a daki a ka̱ri i kabana bware, kwa bware na hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Ina ga̱hi i yiwa na makabgana buniyo na lokaci cimu iza na hyana, hinda na lokaci cimu in hyana ina ga̱hi i yiwa na makabgana buni&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Kamahinda na yiwa na zwamana, i darya̱ hal i hacigage soo ama doone ui same laco. Ama i hacigago i soo nuhin i marenge wawo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Sa bu'a bu ka̱ri i mace, bui hacigaga soo zwama lokaci u sungurwo u kurwo; ama sa bu mace bwa bui ma'ingana na sungurwo zwama a hugi wa̱wo an bu mace bwa na doone. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Harbuni uba sa na ga̠hi: Baniya lokaci nuhin ui hacigago i soo i kurwo, ama na hyanakan hinda soo nuhin ui cinya na wa̱wo, hinda aza buna bui i caga soo u cine. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Sa hun uni u kore iziya na kaba̱ ihya. Kamahinda na zwama, Buca̱ abumui bui pan tibai ga̱hi i kaba na iziya numui. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Hal ka baniya isa na kabanuwo ihya na iziya nimui. kaba̱n hinda ai pan, nga̱ wa̱wo nuhin uba ui sinji.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na iu nasara na Doone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Ko nga̱ uba sa na ia̱ cikarigo na kwatanci zwama i zwama ini, ama lokaci u yiwa na korwo una u gya na za na ia̱ cikarigo haruniyo hinda na za i ia̱kana kwatanci ama sirya murara i ia̱gi cikarigo ci Buca̱ abumui. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Sa hon ni u kore, kaba̱ Buca̱ na ize nimui. Na hinwo na kabagya na madadi a mahinyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />zwama buca na icwa i buba bui i ka̱ri, Bui ka̱ri zwama ina ka̱ri hinda i tani soo na sire pa Hwinsu Buca̱ abumui. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Na sire pa Buca̱ hinda kwa gya na ese na doone; hinda baniya na ginbo i curya doone gya ali pa Buca̱ abumui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Kwa silmajiri sa Bware na kaban bo, &lt;&lt;Baniya bu yiwa na ci ia̱gya cikarigo na pili hinda sa na misali. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Ci daki baniya na bu daki tibai hinda bui karwo buciyayha bu ia̱gi makaba̱. Uni u san ga̱ci tani soo ana bu sire pa Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;I tane soo baniya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Lokaci u yiwa na korwo, u kurwa ma baniya, una ka̱mu nuhin i magatgaga, tiganba bu ali yaba buba. Ina curya̱ gyagya. Ama naza gyagya, ama Buca̱ bu yiwa tare na gya. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Na zwama haruni, nga̱ ga̱hi i hyan dala a burya̠ sa i yiwa tare na gya. Doone ui san i hoge sugoro. Ama ia̱je koce u soo! na hono doone.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i ahunda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi cikarigo cini, kwa bware na hin na byana zata zaro kwa na hin:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">Buca̱ abumui, lokaci a wuco. goo bui pan bwa bubo cilabe, zwam bwa bubo buba bui pan cilabe. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Zwama bu pa bwa koce zata u aco ka̱mu, zwama bware buba bui pan a̱huru ana aza ihogu pa ka̱mu ana yaje na bware. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Uni ube usa a̱huru ana aza ihogu: abiya asa idaku nibwe Hwinsu u kamahinda, hinda bu daki Yesu Kristi ana goo bu cuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ni bu pan cilabe na doone na hogu ibwan ina goo buni pan gya ia̱. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Buca̱ abumui, baniya na cilabe na nubui ina gya na za na goo tuna kapi goo ia̱ doone.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bu ia̱ a̱hunda zwama silmajiri si bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Na san aco na goo buni pan abu daki na doone. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Baniya a daki ana ka̱mu ina gya na za usa daje. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Zwama cicuma cina goo buna zwama na zwama ga, a ce hinda a daki ana Kamahinda ni sirya pa goo, hinda a tani soo ana gabuya buna cuman. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Ni yiwa na ia̱ ahunda̱ zwama ba. Ni iwo ahunda̱ zwama doone ama zwama aco na goo buni pan, zwama asa aco Hwinsu, zwama asaa aco nabui. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Ina gya na ka̱mu za isa nabui, hinda ka̱mu ina goo buzi isa nimui; buyiwa na ciba ga cilabe acimui pa ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na yiwa na kore ahwabui; Ni za ni madalakana na doone hinda, ama aba si yiwa na doone Buca̱ abuci bu nagu ciri, ia̱ kula naba na kuce ize nibu;wato ize nibwe zwama aba sa nya bwenka nga̱ gya nasa bweka na goo. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Nga̱ gya na yansa naba, na iri ga na koce u izi nibui, ize na goo buni pan na iri ga hida aza buna bu inage, kwa buna bu ka̱ri inaga -zwama a sinji ina aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Baniya na kuru ahwan hin. N a yanse na zwamgana ga. i dinya na doone una zwama a hin wa̱wo na dala a burya̠ na ha soo haba. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Na pa ga cicuma acibui aco doone a wanje ga zwama aba asa aco doone nga̱ gya ma na sa buco bu doone. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Na za na ahunda̱ goo zangaciga na doone ama na yiwa na ahunda̱ ta curya buco bu eewo hin na ga. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Zwama asa aco doone, nga̱ gya ma na sa buco bu doone. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Guzaga ga na cikarigo acibui ci kamahinda zwama cikarigo acibui cisa ci kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nga̱ goo bu na cuma na doone harbuniya gya na cumaga na doone. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Zwama aba gya na cuta icwa nimui ahwabui, zwama aba ma ai cuta sicwa saba na kamahinda ahwabui.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahunda a Yesu pa alagan ka̱mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Naza na ia̱ ahunda̱ namui zwama aba baba ama pa aco ka̱mu na tane soo na gya zwama cikarigo cyaba. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Buca a bumui na yiwa na ahunda̱ zwama ka̱mu asa i binka, Buca, buyiwa na suwa namui nga̱ gya ma nayiwa na suwa Buca̱ abumui harbuni aco doone aba ma ai tani soo ana buna cuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Na panaga izangacu ina goo buni pan zwama bu san i binka nga̱ gaci yiwa na goo cisa i buinka: <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Gya na suwa waba goo na suwo nimui. Zwama aco doone daki gabui buni cuma hinda daki nibu kare ga nga̱ goo buni ka̱ri.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Buca̱ abumui, na ginbo aco na goo buni pan a yan na gya na hugo na gya na yiwa hinda a hyan izangacu numui, zwama izangacu ina goo buni pan zwama buni ka̱ri tun na jigu u ia̱gu u doone.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu nagu ciri, aco doone ai dakuwo ama gya nabu daki hinda a daki ana gabui bui cuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Na sana daki nga̱ goo bu yiwa na re gaba na dakacuma ga hinda maka̠la̠ mana ma goo buni ka̱ri ma yana naba hinda ya na yana na soo waba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">A konbe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi ahunda̱ ani, kwa bware na kaca ujaba u Kidron kurwa u kacaso tare na silmajiri sa Bware. Na ukacaso u ujaba aza enta, kwa Yesu na silmajiri sa buba na ese na soo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahuda, ana a cutan Yesu,a daki ihuga ini, zwama Yesu a sano aba na kulag payi na silmajiri saba. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Kwa Yahuda nakore pa inta uni, tare na musoja mu Roma na alabe labe a ihuga i tanaganu i hayahudawa na haparisiyawa. A zange hapicila na hatocila na mahonacumo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu a daki ka̱mu na ina i ia̱ga na Bware, kwa bware na sere na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Ganba ganhi i yiwa na genbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Yesu a Nazaret.&gt;&gt; a cane, Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Gyamui buna bu ganhin i ginbo.&gt;&gt;Yahuda ana a cuta Yesu kwa a yisa tare na ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Inga Yesu aba hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Gyamui,&gt;&gt; Kwa aba tarika kacuta na hene na cinge. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Kwa Yesu na gopa i kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Ganba ganhin i yiwa na genbo?&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na cane, &lt;&lt;Yesu a Nazaret.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />&lt;&lt;Na zwama Gyamui,&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane. &lt;&lt;Sa i yiwa na ginbo numui aco mewa a ali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Bu zwame haruni zwama a sinji ina Bware buba hyen i ia̱ kamahinda: &lt;&lt;Buca, na sa na goo ko buika buna bu goo buna pa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Saminu Bitrus a zase kasakari, a zacige kwa na gwabi bugyama, bulabe bulabe bu gunji bo cube u wa u cuga. (Iziya i bugyama buni isa Malkus.) <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu kwa na hin na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Rigya kasakari na pucu! Bui dakuwo na so sungurwa u adanda an Buca̱ buba na pa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kole Yesu pa bulabe bu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kwa musoja mu Roma na muna mu labe na aco na yiwa na anpe u ihuga i tanaganu i Hayahudawa na konbe Yesu. A pare bware, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />hinda kwa na kole bware pa Hannana ana sabukwase Kayapa, una usa bulabe bulabe uya uni. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayapa abe a pan Hayahudawa shawara an u gyace buco bwekan bu kwaji zwama cagiyaco.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a sisane ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Kwa Saminu Bitrus na acagiye almajiri na lagana Yesu na kacuta̱. silmajiri ani bulabe bulabe bu daki bware dinya, a ise tare na Yesu suwa u pili u yaba ni tare na Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />ama Bitrus a yisan na i'iba na ijapu. Almajiri ana, a bulabe bulabe buba daki, kwa na maringe kacuta, kwa na ia̱ cikarigo na ikangaza ina i yanse na anpe u i'iba an i isiya Bitrus. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ikangaza ina i yiwa na i'iba na kabana Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Go bui sa almajiri a buco buna?&gt;&gt; Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;Aye, na sa,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Duro u yanse, kwa agyama na aco anpe a sana ula kwa na ringana, aba na hobuta ula. Bitrus a ma yabta zwama a hwabuci ula.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulabe bu labe bu ia̱gi Yesu makabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Kwa bulabe bulabe na ia̱gya Yesu makaba̱ ma silmajiri si na icibago i Bware. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Na ia̱gi tiganba cikarigo na pili,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na cibage na muginga a muhin na ihuga i tanaganu nuhin, na ihuga ina Hayahudawa hab matanaga. Nesa tabuwa zwamaga ihya na ciswin. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Bai san hinda go bu yiwa na ia̱gya makaba̱? Eagya aco na sa na kubli. Kaba̱ ga ai zwama ina gya na zwamage. A daki ina gya na zwamage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Nga̱ Yesu aba zwame haruni, kwa musoja buikan an yiwa na anpe kwa ne mala Yesu na hin. &lt;&lt;Harbuni u goo bui cana bulabe bulabe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu a cane bo, &lt;&lt;Sa na zwame ihya ina i gyamacuwa,&gt;&gt; Zwamana tiganba ini. Ama sa na zwame kamahinda, bai san go na supi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Kwa Hannana na kula bware, pa Kayapa kwa bu palage, pa Kayapa bulabe bulabe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a gope i hyen na ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Hal baniya Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus kwa yisan aba na hwabuta ula, kwaaco mewa na kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Go bwe san almajiri a buco buna?&gt;&gt; Ama Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus a sisga, kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Na sa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Kwa bugyama bu bulabe bulabe buna busa dangi u buna bu Bitrus aba gunji cube, kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Ne hyanuwo tare na enta na buco buna?&gt;&gt; Bu kaba. <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Hinda Bitrus a jidane hin, &lt;&lt;Aye&gt;&gt;-a sanuwo kwa uka̱ri u uga.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">A koliye Yesu pa Gwamna Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Na ubungwa ma'inta a zangi Yesu pa yaba i Kayapa kuro pada u Gwamna u Roma. Aco labe hayahudawa ai eseewo na suwa u iginga; a ka̱ri a iri ikanga ya ba ita zana ciri zwama a pan i re mare ma lago ui kacigago. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Zwama haruni, Bilatus a sere na ijapu kwa bangi ga na kaban, &lt;&lt;Baiya ga̱hi kole kara u buco buna?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Kwa aba ne cane, &lt;&lt;Sa ya iwo ihya ca za i kole bo pa goo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Bilatus a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi na sicwa a sihin zangaje bware i ia̱gi bware shara'a nga̱ icibago nihin iba zwamage,&gt;&gt; Ama Hayahudawa a cane bo &lt;&lt;Zwama ai yadwuwa gaci ci hone buciyahya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Uni ia̱gi ka̱mu zwama a sinji ina Yesu aba zwamage, i na bware buba zwamage iri u'o una buba bwe ia̱.) <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Bilatus a ese na suwa u pada, kwa na ugan Yesu, &lt;&lt;Go busa bugwama bu hayahudawa?&gt;&gt; Bu kaba Bware, <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Makaba mani ma sere a pabo ko di aco mewa abe abu ia̱ cikarigo zwama gya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Bilatus a kaba, &lt;&lt;Bu nga̱ ko gya nasa bayahude? Aco naboi na Bulabe bulabe abe a na kulage gya goo. Baiya go bu ia̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Cigwama a cimu cisa ci doone una. sa cigwama a cimu ca sa ci doone, alagano numui ai gazgana ikonbo ina aba na konbehal an cuta pa alabe hayahudawa. Aye, cigwama a cimui cisa ci doone una.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Kwa Bilatus na hin, &lt;&lt;Busa bugwama buniyo!&gt;&gt; Yesu kwa na cane, &lt;&lt;Bu zwame kamahinda nga̱ go bu hin na sa igwamgwa. Kamahinda, ina i sa aba gya na kore na doone bini, zwamage ina sa kamahinda, Buna busa bu kamahinda bui na kubla.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Bilatus a kaba Yesu. &lt;&lt;Baiya isa kamahinda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">A huni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Kwa Bilatus ni sire ni japu pa hayahudawa na hin naba , &lt;&lt;Ni ha̱nuwo i na buco na bu i hal a huni bo.<verse eid="JHN 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ama iza gajo uikan una ga̱hi sa ia̱ hon lago ui kacigago gya sa curi buco buika na ukaba u ci'incu. I ginbo i curigagi bugwama bu hayahudawa&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Kwa aba na danda bicwarwa na koce, &lt;&lt;Aye, sa bware! Ci ginbo Barabas!&gt;&gt; (Barabbas asa buco bu pashi.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">A jukai yesu zata e'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Bilatus a cuta Yesu zwama egyi bware bulala. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Kwa mu soja na naji iparo ikware kwa na bwadan bware na icwa. Kwa na bwadana bware cilapo ci mugwamgwam. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />A kure pa bware kwa na hin, Panija bugwama cilabe, &lt;&lt;A̱huru a Bugwama a yan hal ihogu bu ha Hayahudawa!&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na kure kwa aba na mane bware.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Bilatus a jidana sire kwa na hyin na aco na matanga, &lt;&lt;Byanija, na kulagi Bware i daki na kumbuwa bware na magwata̱ ina i huni bware. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Nga̱ Yesu aba a sire na naji kware kwa Bilatus na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Buci abunhi abuna!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Nga̱ bulabe bu iginga na musoja ape iginga aba hyan bware, kwa aba na sana ci'ogo, &lt;&lt;Jukai bware! jukai bware!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Ama Bilatus a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Zangaja bware huniji bware. ama gya, na kumbuwa bware na magwata̱ hya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Kwa alabe a Hayahudawa na cane bware kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Ai ciza icibago cina ci hyin ana a huni bware, zwama bware bu hyin busa bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Inga Bilatus aba hugi haruni, kwa buba na jidani hugi iwasa, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kwa Bilatus na jidane ise pada. &lt;&lt;Humba goo bu sire?&gt;&gt; bu kaba Yesu, ama Yesu ai canuwa bo. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />&lt;&lt;Zwama haruni kwa Bilatus na hin na bo, &lt;&lt;Bu wanje ia̱ cikarigo na gya?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bui dakuwo ana naza koce gya bu curi ko hinda bu jukai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Kwa Yesu na cane, Ai koce na goo buza masa mana ma Hwinsu uba pa. Zwama haruni buco buna bu ni cibe busa bu magwata̱ dinya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Nga̱ Bilatus bu ba hugi haruni kwa buba na ka̱ri i curi Yesu, kwa Hayahudawa na danda bicaro na sana ci'ogo, &lt;&lt;Si bu curi buco buna, bwe sawa a'osa a Kaisar. Ka̱mu buna bu hin ana busa bugwama bo ka̱ruwo Kaisar.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Nga̱ Bilatus buba hugi haruni, kwa buba na kule Yesu na ijapu kwa Bilatus na dala na idalo mugwamgwam na acagiya huga ana ayiwa na ugan Amama ana aba ma na hatare (Na Cihiburu hinda Gabbata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Hunni usa hun lago ui kacigago, ciyabo na awa cunihi. kwa Bilatus na hyin na Hayahudawa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">&lt;&lt;Buni busa bugwama nuhin,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ama kwa Hayahudawa na danda bicaro na hin &lt;&lt;Zanga bware ahwaya! Zanga bware ahwaya!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Kwa Bilatus na kabanga, &lt;&lt;I ka̱ri gya huni bugwama abunhi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ama kwa bulabe bu iginga na cane, &lt;&lt;Zanga bware! Zanga bware! A jukai bo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ciza acagiya Bugwama kwa Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />kwa Bilatus na pan Yesu zwama a jukai bo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Ihunu i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Kwa musoja na zangi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Kwa Yesu na sere na zanga u'o muco, na kure ihuga ina aba yiwa na uge, ihuga akuku ai icwa, (Ana ayiwa na uge na Cihiburu Golgota). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Apaya aba jukai Yesu, hinda na bware aco barya-buika na wa u gula buika na wa u cuga hinda Yesu na suwa waba.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatus hinda bu rubuci cikarigo, ana aba tana zata u'o muco Yesu: &lt;&lt;YESU BUCO BU NAZARET BUGWAMA BU HAYAHUDAWA.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Hayahudawa dinya hinda akaranci ina aba rubuci na Cihiburu, zwama ihuga ina aba jukai Yesu ayiwa ciyabu na i'ogo na Roma na Hahelinanci. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Kwa bulabe bu iginga a Hayahudawa na danda bicaro na hyin na Bilatus, &lt;&lt;Ta rubuci an bware busa bugwama bu Hayahudawa,&gt; ama bware bu hyin ana bube busa bugwama bu Hayahudawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Kwa Bilatus na cane, &lt;&lt;Ina gya na rigan na rubuci na rubuci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Nga̱ musoja muna mu jukai Yesu, kwa aba na zangi cilapo ci Yesu na mahapsaga aba aco nasi ciki u musoja muni hinda tigamba bu zangi, kashi uinka. Hinda a zangi cilapo ci bware cinaai tabuwa hanje ama a i bo na saka. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Kwa aba na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Cita handa cilapo cini ama ci i kori'a na aba, ci hyan buna bui re.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ini ka̱mu i pale zwama a sinji ina aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu ana a hin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;A hapsaga cilapo acimui ciki waba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">hinda a i kuri'a na cilapo nimu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Hinda musoja muni mu i haruni. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ciyabu na u'o muco u Yesu amaci a bware a yisa, buhun a amaci a bware, Imaryamu bu'a bu Kilobas, hinda na Imaryamu buna bu sirya Magadalin. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Nga̱ Yesu uba hyan amaci a bware na silmajiri a bware ana buba ka̱ri a yinsa ciyabo, Kwa bware na hyin na amaci, &lt;&lt;Bu'a, Bwa nubuya abuna,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kwa Yesu na hin na almajiri si bware, &lt;&lt;Buna busa amaci nabuya.&gt;&gt; Tun daga hunni kwa silmajiri si Yesu na zangi amaci a Yesu na kule pa yaba a bware.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">U'o u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu bu daki an bware bu hogu i ka̱mu, hinda zwama a sinji ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin, Yesu bu hin, &lt;&lt;Na yiwa na ci'unya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />azi miya ma inabi man mazi sungula aba sinji ugola, kwa aba na tana usoso na miya mani ma inabi man mazi sungula, kwa aba na tana i kinda i ulapo na agungu a izob kwa aba na zangi na tan pa unu u Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Nga̱ aba tana miya ma inabi man mazi sungula kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Ahogu!&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na huka na icwa yaba na curi anhuru a buba.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kwa alabe a Hayahudawa ni kaba̱ Bilatus ana a yajega zwama a buse buna wa aco na aba jukai hinda a kasingiya ikanga yaba na u'o muco. a kaba̱ ini zwama usa hun Juma'a, hinda ai ka̱ruwo ikanga yaba a yinsa na u'on masacu hal hon ihupacu u hayahudawa, zwama hon ihupacu u hayahudawa masa hon nagu ciri. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Kwa musoja na kure pa aco na aba jukai na Yesu kwa aba makare buna bu buco bwenka kwa aba na mawalan na makakare buna bulagi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ama nga̱ aba kure pa Yesu kwa aba na bangi Yesu bu rigan bu kwada, ai kakariwa buna bware. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Kwa buco buinka ciki u musoja na sapi Yesu na umashi. na cagiya u ikanga i buba, kwa mahya na miya na sire. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Buco buna bu buba hyan ina pale bube bu hin haruni, hinda ka̱mu ina buba hin isa kamahinda, hinda bu pan usheda zwama goo ma bui tan soo. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ina i pale zwama a sinji cikarigo ci Hwinsu, wato, &lt;&lt;Aza makakari unpa uinka ciki a unpa u bware,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Hinda acagiya cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin, &lt;&lt;Ai byana buna aba sape.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumbanu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Nga̱ haruni uba i, Yusuf buco bu Arimatiya, buna busa almajiri a Yesu ama na cisunyi zwama iwasa i Hayahudawa, bu kaba̱ Bilatus bu pan bo umurni zwama bware bu zangi ikanga i Yesu. Bulatusa hinda bu yaji kwa bware na kure na zangi ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimos buna bu tabi kure huga Yesu na gita. Nikodimos bu kurya na utarare u musare dinya wato mur na alos a gami na huga uinka, a wuci kilo kupe tah. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kwa aco na barya na zangi ikanga i Yesu na tana na ulapo ka̱mu na icwana i kamshi nga̱ al'ada a Hayahudawa a wumbanu. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Aza inta ciyabu na ihuga ina aba huni Yesu, na suwa u inta niya aza izi an ai tabuwa wumban buco. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Zwama usa hun u kimgano u Hayahudawa kapi hun ui hupaco, hinda izi ni iyiwa ciyabu naba kwa aco na tana ikanga i Yesu na ihuga ci.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Wansegewa u Yesu pa aco a kwajo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Hon lahadi ma'inta ma'inta, kapi ihuga cingilagya, Imaryamu Magadalin i kore pa izi a bangi tare una aba kubta i'eba i izi a swabuke. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kwa iba ne ia̱man munda kurwo pa Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus na sicagiya silmajiri, ana Yesu aba ka̱ri, na hin naba, &lt;&lt;A zangacu Buca̱ bu yaba na suwa ui izi, hinda ci dakuwo ihuga ina aba kule Bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Kwa Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus na acagiya almajiri ne kore pa izi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ka̠mu aba aco barya aba na monda, ama almajiri a mewa a ia̱man monda a zwalagi Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus a wuci izi kapi bware. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Bware bu kuki ama bui hyanuwo ulapo u cine an aba sa nadagi i'o, ama bui esewa na suwa, <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />kwa Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus, ana a yanse na laga na kacuta ne kore pa izi. Bware bu hyan ulapo man aba sa nadagi i'o a labute. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na ulapo ana aba nadagi icwa i Yesu. ulapo ama nadagi na icwa yaba. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Almajiri ana a zwalagi Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus ne kore pa izi, bu ise, buhyan hinda bu tani soo. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Ai dakuwo na cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci hin ai asinga bware kacumo pa aco a kwajo.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kwa silmajiri na ala yaba.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a silta Imaryamu Magadalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />ama Imaryamu i yinsa na ijapu i izi iba ne darya. Nga̱ iba kuki iba ne darya, i kuki zwama i byane izi <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />i hyan acuma a Hwinsu barya na hazunga ha cine, kwa ama dale ihuga ina aba labute ikanga i Yesu, uikan pa icwa u cage na buna. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />A kaba bo, &lt;&lt;Bu'a, bai sa go bu yiwa na darya?&gt;&gt; Bu cane, &lt;&lt;A zangaci Buca̱ bu yaba a bumui,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hinda na dakuwo ihuga ina aba iri Bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Kwa buba ne mabicika na hya Yesu a yinsa; bui dakuwo na Yesu abe na icwa yaba. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />&lt;&lt;Bu'a, bai san goo bu yiwa na darya?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba bo. &lt;&lt;Ganba goo bu yiwa na ginbo?&gt;&gt; Bu ingana busa bu izi bu enta, i hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Sa gabui bu zangi bware, Buca̱ bu yaba, na zwama ihuga ina go bu kole bware, na kore zangi bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu a cane bo, &lt;&lt;Imaryamu!&gt;&gt; Kwa buba ne mabicika na hin na Cihiburu, &lt;&lt;Rabboni!&gt;&gt; (Ina isa &lt;&lt;Walami.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu a hyen na buba, &lt;&lt;Ta na kunba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Zwama na sa maringewa pa buca̱ a bumui. Ama ala pa buhun nimui zwama ga, &lt;Na yiwa na maringya pa buca a bumui na buca a buhin, Hwinsu nimui na Hwinsu waba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Kwa Imaryamu Magadalin ni kore pa silmajiri na cikarigo cini: &lt;&lt;Na hyan Buca̱ bu yaba!&gt;&gt; Hinda kwa iba ne zwaman ga ka̱mu ina buba zwama en.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a silta silmajiri sa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Hon lahadi na uyenbe, silmajiri kwa ma tanaga mu'iba kwa mu gudaga zwama iwasa i Hayahudawa ha labe, Yesu a kore kwa ne yisana na usa waba. Kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;I burya̠ i yan na ga̱hi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Nga̱ bware buba hyen haruni, Bware bu cibe ga siwa na usala u mu'abo mu bware. Nga̱ Silmajiri siba hyan Buca̱ bu yaba kwa na sinji na wawo<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu a jidane hin naba, &lt;&lt;I burya̠ ya na ga̱hi! Nga̱ Buca̱ buba bo na uga, gya na yiwa na cuman.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nga̱ buba zwame haruni, kwa na hulan ga muhonjo mu buba kwa ne hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ca je a̱huru a Hwinsu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Sa i curigagi aco magwata̱ maba, ai curigage ga; sai curigaguwo ga, aza icurigagya ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Toma hinda ana asa silmajiri ikope na sirya, (Ana aba ogo agilo), a yanuwa nga̱ Yesu aba a kore pa ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kwa silmajiri sa mewa na zwamana bware, &lt;&lt;Ci ha̱n Buca̱ bu Yaba!&gt;&gt; Kwa Tomas na cyani ga, &lt;&lt;Kwa na ha̱n urwana na ihuga ina aba cubi bware na ukosa na tane ibwabwa na urwana u ihuga na aba sape bware gya tani soo.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Nga̱ moho u tataco muba ia̱ silmajiri sa bware siba na yaba kwa gudaga i'iba, hinda Toma aba tare naba, Yesu a kore kwa na yisan pa ba kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;I burya̠ i yan na ga̱hi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kwa Bware na hin na Toma, &lt;&lt;Tana ibwabwa nebo a pi; hyana siwa a simui. nume wa dangi usala u mu'abo. Curya nagu ui tani soo nebo, tani soo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma a hin na Bware, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba a bumui na Hwinsu numui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Kwa Yesu na hin na Toma, &lt;&lt;Zwama go bu na hyan, ube sa go bu tani soo; Unu burya̠ isa buna bu tani soo ama bui na hyanuwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ina utakad a una uba sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu a ia̱gi i mamaki dinyiya tare na silmajiri saba ina aba ai rubucuwo na utakada una. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ama a rubuci uni zwama ga̱hi i tani soo na Yesu asa Kristi, Bwa bu Hwinsu, hinda sa tani soo bui hyan a̱huru ana aza ihogu na izi i buba.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a silta silmajiri utandarya̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ban na uni Yesu a gope i cibe icwa ya ba pa silmajiri sa ba, pa iwo u Tibariya. Nga̱ aba ia̱gi bina: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Saminu Bitrus, Toma (An aba ogo agilo), na Nataniyel (buna busa bu Ka'ana u Galili), na saawo sa Zabadi, na silmajiri si Yesu a yanse ka̱mu. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Saminu ana aba ogo Bitrus a hin na si cagige silmajiri, &lt;&lt;Na gibo i kore i kumbago i murege,&gt;&gt; A cane bware, &lt;&lt;Ci kore tare na go.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ne kore tare na ala na jirigi u miya u noya, ama na gita ani ka̱mu ai konbowa ihya.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Hwinsu uba ne sere Yesu a yinsa na ugagi uwo, ama silmajiri sa dakuwo na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Kwa Yesu na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Alagasa, i sa kunbuwa murege?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">&lt;&lt;Ko ihya,&gt;&gt; a cane bware.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kwamana iyi kunbago i murege pa wa u cuga u jirigi u miya nuhin, i konbe.&gt;&gt; wa aba ne kwamana iyi kumbago i muryage hal ka̱ri mayaga ne zangaci, zama a konbe muryage dinya.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Kwa almajiri an a Yesu aba ka̱ri na hin na Saminu buna aba yiwa ne oge Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba pa!&gt;&gt; Nga̱ Bitrus aba hoge na Yesu abe a yiwa na korwo, kwa bware na zangi cilapo ci bware kwa na mabwadana (Zwama bu mabwajege sa ca) kwa buba na matana na miya. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Si cagiya silmajiri sa kore na ugagi u miya pa jirigi u miya uba yiwa, na numi iyi kunbago i murege, zwama a mirewa na u gagi u miya, u wuci buna dari u taco. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Nga̱ aba sere miya ni ugagi, a hyan haisa ha ula na ca ula na murege zata, na burodi.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Kwa Yesu na hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Kuleyaje murege muna mu ga̱hi i kunbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Saminu Bitrus a kore pa miya u miya kwa na numi iyo i kunbgo u murege kuro ugagi u miya. u sinji na murege mu labe, 153 ka̱mu u mu ba, ko nga̱ buba mose iyi kunbago i murege i ma hanjuwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu a hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Kurya je i makare.&gt;&gt; Aza almajiri ana a kaba bware, &lt;&lt;Go busa ganba?&gt;&gt; zwama a daki busa Buca̱ bu yaba <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu a kore pa ba yiwa, a zangaci burodi na pan ga hinda kwa na ia̱ harbuni na murege. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Uni ube usa so utaco Yesu aba a sire pa silmajiri sa bware pa buba wasingoo pa aco na kwadaga.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Bitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Nga̱ aba hogi ire i mare, Yesu a hin na Saminu Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Saminu bwa bu Yohana, bu na ka̱ri nga̱ acagiya na aba na ka̱ri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">&lt;&lt;I, Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Bu daki na bu ka̱ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ryagacuma hatamui a hamui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kwa Yesu na jidana i hin, &lt;&lt;Saminu bwa bu Yohana, kamahinda buna ka̱ri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Bo cane, &lt;&lt;I Buca̱ bu yaba, bu daki na bu ka̱ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu kwa na cane, &lt;&lt;Kumgaga hatamui a hamui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu a kaba i kaba nu i tacula, &lt;&lt;Saminu bwa bu Yohana, bu na ka̱ri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Bitrus a hacigage soo nga̱ Yesu aba kaba bware hal utaco, &lt;&lt;Buna ka̱ri?&gt;&gt; Bu hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, bu daki i ka̱mu; bu daki na bu ka̱ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Ryacuma hatamui a hamu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kamahinda na yiwa na bu zwamana, lokaci una go bu sanse bulagasa, sa i ia̱ siri ali ihuga ina goo bu ginbo; ama nga̱ go bu onge bui nume wa neboi bucage buco bui bu bwada hazunga bu kole ihuga ina goo bui ka̱ruwo i kore.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(I zwamo i haruni, Yesu a ginbe a cibe iri u'o una Bitrus aba ai kwaji zwama a pan Hwinsu cilabe.) Kwa Yesu na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Na laganya̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na almajiri ana bware buba ka̱ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Kwa Bitrus na byana kacuta, kwa buba na hyan silmajiri sina buba ka̱ri na lagan bo. (Buni busa silmajiri buna buyiwa ciyabu na Yesu na hun lago u ikacigago na hin, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, gamba bui bu cibe?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Nga̱ Bitrus uba hyan bo, kwa bware na kaban Yesu. &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu Yaba, buco buna busa gamba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Kwa Yesu na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Si usa ina gya na ka̱ri uba i bware bu yan na a̱huru hal gya i giwo, biya bu dame? Goo di ni laganya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Zwama haruni a zwama cikarigo ci bware na suwa a alagano a Yesu na hin almajiri a̱ce buza i kwaji. Ama Yesu i hinwo na gabwe ana buza ikwaji; bu hin kawui, &lt;&lt;Si nupi numuiya bu yan na a̱huru hal uhogu, hal gya gi, biya ma dame?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Bube busa silmajiri bun yiwa na pan sheda na ini ka̱mu, hinda bu rubuciga; hinda ci daki ina bware bu hin usa u kamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Baniya aza i dinya mana Yesu ubua i . Si a rubuci uwa uika̱ na uika̱, ko doone na ma uza ipwa zanga utakada una ai rubuci.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>